&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy using mathematics and code to investigate difficult questions, you could make a direct contribution to Optiver’s success in global markets. As a Graduate Quantitative Researcher, you’ll work across the full research process, from framing the question and choosing the data to building, testing and deploying models. Machine Learning is central to the work, whether you’re extracting signals, forecasting prices or modelling relationships. Our data, compute and production infrastructure let you test ideas quickly, understand where they fail and decide what to investigate next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our researchers believe in academic discourse and invite fellow researchers, traders and engineers to challenge each hypothesis. Different perspectives help improve the question, the model and how it performs in production. Through constant testing, analysis and refinement, you’ll help our quantitative models adapt as markets evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your onboarding&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;participate&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ONPObMHh-k8&quot;&gt;Global Optiver Academy&lt;/a&gt;, a structured&amp;nbsp;onboarding programme for graduates. It gives new joiners a shared foundation in how Optiver trades, builds systems, and manages risk before they move into their teams.&amp;nbsp;As part of your onboarding,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;gain exposure to the AI tools and technologies that support research and development across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the team you join, you&#39;ll own the research end to end. That could include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building models for pricing, forecasting and signal discovery, choosing the statistical, mathematical or Machine Learning methods that best fit the problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across petabytes of market, order-flow and unstructured data to find signals that improve strategies as conditions change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring models in production and using live behavior to refine your assumptions and decide what to investigate next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using deep learning and AI-enabled workflows to shorten the loop from hypothesis to evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with researchers, traders and engineers to shape problems and understand how system constraints affect performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for aspiring Quantitative Researchers who are versatile and creative in innovating and suggesting new solutions. In return, we&#39;ll give you the freedom to pursue your ideas and implement them right into our production systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In terms of skills and qualifications, we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An academic degree in Engineering, Physics, Maths, Econometrics, Computer science or equivalent, with outstanding academic achievements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience in any language (preferably Python, but C, C++, Basic, JAVA, etc. are also a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to apply concepts of probability, calculus and linear algebra&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive attitude and eagerness to constantly improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written English language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talent colleagues, working collaboratively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health benefits, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, bi-weekly chair massages, Friday afternoon drinks, a bicycle to explore Amsterdam and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW TO APPLY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you interested in furthering your career on one of the most dynamic and exciting trading floors in Europe?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Graduate Quantitative Researcher. Please provide us with a CV in English.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Unfortunately we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your application is selected to proceed to the next round, you will be required to complete online assessments. By submitting your application you are confirming that you will be able to take the assessment within 7 days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team via the &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot;&gt;contact form&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot;&gt;recruitment FAQ&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;*Optiver has a global application re-apply policy for our intern and graduate roles. If you have completed an online assessment or interviewed for a quantitative graduate or internship role at any Optiver location in the past 8 months, please note that you are not yet eligible to reapply. We welcome you to re-apply after the 8-month cool off period.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London or UK Remote | 💰 £150,000 - £200, 000 + Equity +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our Data Discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a strong culture of data-driven decision making across the whole company. Data is central to how we understand our customers, shape our products, manage risk and grow Monzo sustainably. We believe in empowering teams with high-quality, trusted data and self-serve analytics, while creating space for Data practitioners to focus on the highest-impact questions, opportunities and decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Data discipline is centralised, but deeply embedded in Monzo’s product areas. Data Scientists, Analytics Engineers, Machine Learning Engineers and Analysts work in cross-functional squads alongside Engineers, Designers, Product Managers, Marketers and other specialists. This means Data is not a downstream service: we help shape strategy, challenge thinking, build the data foundations teams need to move quickly, and share accountability for customer and commercial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Payments team ⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, payments are more than just moving money from A to B. They are a core part of how customers experience trust, speed, and financial control every day. As a Data Director in Payments, you would help shape seamless local payment experiences, ensuring customers can pay and get paid reliably while continuing to modernise the infrastructure that powers millions of transactions behind the scenes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role also sits at the intersection of Monzo’s broader ambition to build truly borderless banking and expand into new markets. That means designing products and payment capabilities that work effortlessly across geographies, currencies, and customer needs, while helping Monzo scale into new markets with the same simplicity and transparency that defines the brand today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Design to help shape Monzo’s payments strategy to make Monzo&#39;s global ambitions a reality, enabling revenue and customer growth with a resilient, self-serve banking platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed, you should be excited about solving tough, ambiguous business problems with analytical rigour, commercial viability and execution effectiveness&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day-to-day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish yourself as a trusted member of the Payments Leadership team, enabling better decisions across Payments and the wider Data Discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-drive Payments strategy and product decisions with Product and Engineering, bringing Data into discovery early to shape priorities and challenge thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify untapped opportunities for commercial optimisation, including across pricing, commercialisation, investment and customer growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the data strategy for Payments, including the operating model, team priorities, architecture, technical debt and key metrics and drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate between technical, product and commercial perspectives to help teams make clear, high-impact decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale a high-performing team of data professionals sharing accountability for product and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we’re doing here at Monzo excites you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience driving payments innovation and product strategy forward in a fast-growing business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine deep Data expertise with strong product and commercial judgement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can move comfortably from detailed metrics or architecture discussions to customer strategy, pricing and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an empathetic people leader who can build trust quickly, raise the performance bar and retain excellent talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience growing and leading a full stack data team, including individual contributors and managers across Data Science, Analytics Engineering, Machine Learning Engineering and Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience collaborating with senior cross-functional stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Design, Marketing and risk/control functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After an informal ~30 min recruiter call, our interview process involves 2 main stages. We promise not to ask you any brain teasers or trick questions!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initial Call (1 hour)&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll meet with one of our senior data leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loop Stage&lt;/strong&gt; - This is one stage with 4 interviews (totalling 4 hours) split between a collaboration with one of our engineers on a technical exercise, as well as behavioural and leadership interviews. You can have this all in one day or split these across multiple days, whichever your prefer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3-4 weeks but we will always work around your availability. You will have the chance to speak to our recruitment team at various points during your process but if you do have any specific questions ahead of this please contact us on -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work 💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Locations &amp;amp; Flexible Working :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our main tech hub is in London, but our engineers live everywhere in the UK— from Brighton to the Western Isles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value meeting in person but there’s no pressure to come into the office, even if you&#39;re nearby. We believe you&#39;ll do your best work if you are where you want to be. If you live outside of London and we ask you to come into the office, Monzo will support you with the costs. ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are naturally social, especially Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays, which happen to line up with our twice-weekly Monzo lunches &amp;amp; treat Thursdays 🍽️. Teams also schedule time together often for work and play – in or around the office, or online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set up a work schedule that delivers impact and fits your life.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we value connections, flexibility, and wellbeing. We keep our meetings during core hours to stay connected and believe in maintaining work/life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be empowered to manage your work in a way that suits you and your team, giving you the freedom for children drop-offs and pick-ups, walking your dog or adventurous cat, avoiding peak commuting times or gym slots, appointments, or supporting your family in an emergency. 🕒✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work the way that works for you with Monzo! 💼&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰Base salary £150, 000 - £200, 000 + Equity + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AL1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has full ownership of euNetworks&#39; market-leading Ultra-Low Latency (ULL) trading product. You will be accountable for the strategy, commercial performance, investment decisions and long-term growth of a network that serves some of the world&#39;s most sophisticated financial institutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate as the business owner for euTrade, with direct responsibility for its P&amp;amp;L and the freedom to shape its future direction. Your decisions will dictate where we invest, which routes we build, how we compete and how we maintain our leadership position in one of the most demanding and competitive markets in telecommunications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who enjoys solving difficult problems, accountability, uncovering opportunities before competitors do and building defensible advantages. While an interest in networks and financial markets is helpful, we place far greater value on commercial judgement, intellectual curiosity, strategic thinking and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;ve read &lt;em&gt;Flash Boys&lt;/em&gt; by Michael Lewis, or you’ve watched &lt;em&gt;The Hummingbird Project&lt;/em&gt; and found yourself fascinated by the commercial value of latency, the race to build faster routes and the strategic importance of infrastructure, this role offers the opportunity to shape and grow one of the industry&#39;s leading ultra-low-latency platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the project management and product P&amp;amp;L, including revenue growth, profitability and cost leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build business cases and evaluate investment opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define pricing strategy and support sales drive return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand the Market Better Than Anyone Else&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of exchange growth, liquidity shifts, mergers, acquisitions and venue migrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand trading firm and market data provider business models, points-of-presence, and the value of latency within their ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse competitor strategies, strengths, network developments and customer loyalty dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to create unique and defensible competitive advantages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Winning Strategies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply game theory, competitive assessment and structured problem-solving to identify and develop unique, defendable route opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate competitor behaviour, market dynamics and strategic trade-offs to determine the most effective investment and go-to-market decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess risks, scenarios and potential responses before committing resources, adapting strategies as market conditions evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, market intelligence and commercial insight to guide decision-making and strengthen competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the Product Lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define product strategy and long-term roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage lifecycle decisions across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new logo acquisition, cross-sell and upsell campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Relationships Across the Ecosystem and combined with market Intelligent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic relationships with customers, partners and industry stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence decision-makers and build credibility across the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate commercial agreements and partnership opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Sales in customer engagements and product positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we want from you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Instinct&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgement and an ownership mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating opportunities, investments and business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance growth, profitability and strategic positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable making decisions with incomplete information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Problem Solving Ability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured and analytical approach to complex challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding attention to detail especially during planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to assess options, risks and competitive responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural curiosity and a desire to understand how markets really work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in strategy, incentives, game theory and competitive dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shrewd Tactical Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy competition and finding ways to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You anticipate competitor actions and position accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how small advantages can compound into meaningful market leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are constantly looking for opportunities to create sustainable differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Motivation and Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A go-getter mentality with a bias towards execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working autonomously and leading from the front&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to challenge the status quo and pursue opportunities proactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to build momentum and deliver outcomes without waiting for direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building and Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trust with customers, partners and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable supporting executive-level discussions and negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at aligning diverse stakeholders behind a common objective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Curiosity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A base level of technical literacy in networking, DWDM and optical infrastructure is desirable, but most important is the willingness and capacity to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You do not need to be a network engineer, but you should be capable of understanding how technology choices create commercial advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, we&#39;re looking for someone who combines the mindset of a strategist, the curiosity of an investigator and the accountability of a business owner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this position is of interest but you don’t think you meet all of the criteria listed, please consider applying still. euNetworks looks to recruit people with the right attitude, potential and ambition and for the right candidate, we will provide further training and support to enable you to develop in the role.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja is looking for an enthusiastic Mechanical Systems Engineer to join the Systems Engineering group within Shark &amp;amp; Ninja Engineering. You&#39;ll identify key system-level requirements, prototype and test to fill gaps where requirements are unclear, align with cross-functional teams, and iterate as projects evolve through development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are some of the EXCITING things you&#39;ll get to do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product definition by communicating system functions and requirements across disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build proof-of-concept prototypes with microcontrollers and 3D-printed designs to shape early product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide engineering, electrical, and marketing teams on tradeoffs within complex thermal and electromechanical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop unique product design solutions for Shark &amp;amp; Ninja products sold globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, design, build, and test new products across the full lifecycle within a multi-disciplinary team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on in the lab to evaluate, test, and fix design prototypes and production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret test results and feed findings back into product improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ATTRIBUTES &amp;amp; SKILLS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS or MS in Mechanical Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in electro-mechanical systems engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience programming microcontrollers — reading sensor data and controlling actuators (motors, LEDs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3D CAD modeling experience (CREO or SolidWorks preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with 3D printing and production processes such as injection molding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of mechanical engineering fundamentals and DFM manufacturing techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred:&lt;/em&gt; Experience designing/testing consumer products, electromechanical devices, or small appliances; strong analytical skills and ownership of problem resolution; hands-on machine shop/fabrication skills; electronics (analog/digital) and test equipment knowledge; comfort working fast-paced and switching gears; passion for great products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, we don’t just raise the bar—we push past it every single day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Outrageously Extraordinary mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; drives us to tackle the impossible, push boundaries, and deliver results that others only dream of. If you thrive on breaking out of your swim lane, you’ll be right at home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer competitive health insurance, retirement plans, paid time off, employee stock purchase options, wellness programs, SharkNinja product discounts, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower your personal and professional growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with high impact Learning Programs featuring bold voices redefining what’s possible. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join, you’re not just part of a company—you’re part of an outrageously extraordinary community. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;gether, we won’t just launch products—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;we’ll disrupt entire markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion are vital to our global success. Valuing each unique voice and blending all of our diverse skills strengthens SharkNinja’s innovation every day. We support ALL associates in bringing their authentic selves to work, making an impact, and having the opportunity for career acceleration. With help from our leadership, associates, and our community, we aim to have equity be a key component of the SharkNinja DNA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
