&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5/7+ years’ experience in consulting, project/program management, partnerships, complex sales&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar roles in fintech, e‑commerce, or other fast‑paced/high‑growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and French.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instinct and business acumen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with data; able to extract insights and deliver compelling partner presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple complex stakeholders and partners in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record leading cross‑functional projects with high attention to detail.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also are a&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communicator and relationship‑builder: excellent written and presentation skills; you craft compelling value propositions and engage stakeholders effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic and impact‑focused: you prioritize high‑leverage actions and thrive in fast‑paced settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem‑solving and results‑oriented: you own outcomes and deliver on commitments; strong analytical skills and comfort with ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech‑curious, a continuous learner, resilient, and adaptable to shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
