&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt; About the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Legal supports Alma to grow safely and sustainably by anticipating and managing legal risk, providing pragmatic advice, negotiating contracts, and supporting teams across the company; in a strongly regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Legal&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;reports to Alma’s General Secretary and lead the Legal function. You will be a trusted partner to the Director’s Committee and work closely with Product, Tech, Sales, Operations, Finance, Risk, Compliance, Information Security and People.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also act as Alma’s Data Protection Officer, with the independence, resources and direct access to senior management required to perform the role effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a permanent position based in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Legal, you will define Alma’s legal and privacy strategy and ensure that it supports the company’s business ambitions, regulatory obligations and risk appetite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and lead Alma’s legal strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a clear legal roadmap aligned with Alma’s business and international strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, assess and manage Alma’s main legal risks, escalating material matters to executive management and governance bodies when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, pragmatic and business-oriented advice to the Executive Committee and teams across Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex legal requirements into actionable recommendations, policies and scalable operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor relevant legal developments across Alma’s markets and anticipate their impact on the company’s products and activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Alma’s business, products and partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product and Tech teams throughout the design and launch of new products and features, embedding legal and privacy considerations from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Sales, Account Management, Operations and other business teams on strategic projects and complex legal questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the drafting, review and negotiation of commercial agreements, including agreements with merchants, partners, suppliers and technology providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable contracting standards, templates, playbooks and approval processes that enable teams to move quickly while controlling legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on strategic transactions, partnerships, outsourcing arrangements and international expansion projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee corporate and governance matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Alma’s corporate legal matters and ensure that its legal entities comply with applicable governance and corporate requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive management and governance bodies in preparing decisions and maintaining appropriate corporate documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on financing, corporate transactions, intellectual property, competition law and other strategic legal matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate external counsel and manage the legal budget, ensuring that external expertise is used effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee litigation, pre-litigation, claims and other disputes, defining the appropriate strategy and protecting Alma’s interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as Alma’s Data Protection Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and oversee Alma’s data protection framework in accordance with the GDPR and other applicable privacy laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform and advise Alma and its employees on their data protection obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor compliance through appropriate policies, processes, controls and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and continuously improve Alma’s privacy governance, including records of processing activities, privacy notices, retention standards and procedures for handling data-subject requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a robust framework for data protection impact assessments and ensure that DPIAs are conducted when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product, Tech, Data, Risk, Operations, Marketing and People teams on privacy-by-design and privacy-by-default principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Information Security on personal-data breaches, incident response, security measures and regulatory notifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as Alma’s primary contact for data protection authorities and cooperate with them when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop training and awareness initiatives to foster a strong data protection culture throughout Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the Legal team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear vision, priorities and operating model for the Legal team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach and develop team members, promoting high standards of expertise, ownership and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocate resources according to business priorities and ensure that legal requests are handled effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define meaningful objectives and indicators to measure the team’s impact, service quality and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships across Alma and position Legal as both a strategic partner and an independent control function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You combine excellent legal judgment with a strong understanding of business. You are comfortable taking clear positions on complex matters while remaining pragmatic and solution-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are likely to thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can move comfortably between strategic questions and hands-on legal work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how to balance business velocity, customer experience, innovation and legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex legal matters clearly to both legal and non-legal audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior leaders and challenge decisions constructively when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy developing people and creating clarity for a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working with incomplete information and taking ownership of sensitive or high-impact decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong negotiation, drafting and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in both French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a Master’s degree in law or an equivalent legal qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience in senior legal positions (15+ years), combining experience in a leading bank or FinTech and a law firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong expertise in banking, commercial and technology contracts, corporate matters and business law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international activities and working across several European jurisdictions would also be valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the level of expertise and professional standing required to act as Data Protection Officer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because of the strategic importance of this role, the recruitment process will be thorough while remaining as efficient as possible. It is expected to include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An introductory conversation with the Talent Acquisition team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with the General Secretary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical case study focused on legal strategy, business partnering and data protection with key members of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetings with key members of Alma’s leadership and relevant cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with one of our co-founders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alma is a Next40 French fintech founded in 2018 with a clear mission: to put finance back at the service of commerce.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We provide flexible payment solutions that help merchants grow while giving consumers a smarter, more transparent way to pay. Our platform enables businesses to increase conversion, average basket size, and customer loyalty, while delivering a better customer experience at checkout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In just four years, Alma has built a strong position in the enterprise market, becoming a strategic growth partner for leading brands such as La Redoute, SNCF, ManoMano, Jardiland, Maisons du Monde, and Toyota. Today, more than 25,000 merchants use Alma, and more than 10 million consumers have used our solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alma is entering an exciting new phase. We operate across 10 European markets, have grown by 30% year over year, and generated more than €100 million in ARR in 2025. We also reached profitability in 2025, giving us the ability to combine ambitious growth with a sustainable, disciplined business model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 380 Almakers across Europe, Alma offers the scale and credibility of an established fintech, combined with the ownership, pace, and impact of a company still building its next chapter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For an Enterprise Account Executive, this is an opportunity to join a high-performing team at a pivotal moment: enterprise sales is becoming an increasingly important growth engine for Alma, and there is significant scope to shape our approach across Europe. You will work with some of the region’s most recognized brands, lead complex, high-value sales cycles, engage with senior decision-makers, and help define how Alma creates measurable value for large merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Enterprise Sales Manager, you will lead strategic and complex enterprise sales cycles: partnering directly with our C-Levels on strategic accounts, collaborating with our key technology and advisory partners (PSP, CMS, Orchestrators, Consulting firms…), and coordinating across every department of the company (Product, Legal, Finance, Marketing, Account Management, Solution Engineering, Compliance, Risk/Fraud) to land deals from €500k to several million euros in ARR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is a permanent role, based in Paris.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the job&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospecting &amp;amp; Business Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute your own hunting strategy to identify and engage the best enterprise accounts on the French market, across all verticals (retail, e-commerce, services, distribution, travel, automotive...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through outbound (cold outreach, LinkedIn, events, network) in addition to inbound opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify rigorously based on strategic fit, transaction volume, and growth potential&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Deal Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles from discovery to close (typically 6 to 18 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build compelling, ROI-driven business cases tailored to each account&#39;s commercial reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work side by side with our CRO, CEO, and strategic partners on key accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage RFP processes and negotiate contracts in collaboration with Legal and Finance teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internally across Product, Account Management, Marketing and Solution Engineering to craft the right solution for each strategic account&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface competitive insights, prospect feedback, and market signals to sharpen our go-to-market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the continuous improvement of our sales playbook and positioning&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Forecasting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain rigorous pipeline hygiene in Salesforce and deliver accurate, reliable forecasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to team rituals (weekly pipeline reviews, monthly business reviews)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧰 You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aircall&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Navigator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧩 About you&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;3-5 years of B2B Enterprise sales experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with a proven track record of closing large, complex deals involving multi-stakeholder processes,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At ease in high-stakes conversations:&lt;/strong&gt; You are confident engaging with CEO, MD, CFO and senior decision-makers by demonstrating preparation, credibility, and a clear grasp of what moves their business,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious:&lt;/strong&gt; You always do your homework, you walk into every conversation knowing your prospect&#39;s business, their challenges, and what a win looks like for them, before you even think about presenting a solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open to mastering a complex space:&lt;/strong&gt; Payments is a technical and complex industry, you do not need to arrive as an expert, but you bring the intellectual humility to learn fast, ask the right questions, and grow into a trusted advisor over time,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine drive:&lt;/strong&gt; You do not wait for pipeline to land, you build it, shape it, and own it, through creative outreach, disciplined follow-through, and a relentless focus on creating opportunities where others see closed doors,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Natural listener:&lt;/strong&gt; You know that understanding comes before convincing, you ask questions that open up conversations, and you let prospects reveal what matters most to them before you respond,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Built for the long game:&lt;/strong&gt; Enterprise cycles are rarely linear, you stay methodical and constructive through the slow moments, and you know how to keep a deal alive and moving without forcing it,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background selling into retail or e-commerce verticals is a plus, but we welcome hunters from any industry,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent French &amp;amp; English&lt;/strong&gt; required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧘&amp;nbsp;What’s in it for you&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own strategic enterprise accounts and deals worth €500k to several million euros in ARR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell to senior decision-makers at leading European brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape Alma’s enterprise sales motion and expansion across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Product, Risk, Legal, Finance, and Solution Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a profitable, high-growth company where your contribution is visible and meaningful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from strong autonomy, clear impact, and room to grow with the business&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on 12 months with uncapped OTE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport&lt;/strong&gt;: membership with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Gymlib&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Classpass&lt;/strong&gt;, or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€30/month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maternity/paternity leave&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD)&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€544.80/year&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€10/day&lt;/strong&gt;, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental health:&lt;/strong&gt; free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off&lt;/strong&gt;: 25 days/year ****(+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;each year during summer&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯&amp;nbsp;Interview Process&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30’ Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member&lt;/strong&gt; to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45’ Video call with your future manager&lt;/strong&gt; to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;60’ Case study presentation with 2-3 team members (in our Paris office)&lt;/strong&gt; to assess your practical knowledge**.**&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45’ CRO interview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30’ Team fit&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧡&lt;strong&gt; About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;👐&lt;strong&gt; About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Alma Wallet builds the payment experience of the Alma app. With the Alma card, consumers can pay with Alma anywhere, not only at our partner merchants. In the app, they manage their payments with the method of their choice: Apple Pay, Google Pay or local payment methods. By taking Alma beyond our merchant network, the Alma card is one of the company&#39;s key strategic bets. You will report to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/tony-miksa/&quot;&gt;Tony&lt;/a&gt;, Senior Engineering Manager, and work closely with Justine, Product Manager, to bring it to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is a CDI based in Paris, with a hybrid work model.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;💼&lt;strong&gt; About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the Alma Wallet roadmap: &lt;/strong&gt;the Alma card, and bringing new payment methods (Apple Pay, Google Pay, local payment methods), identity verification and Open Banking to the mobile app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow the Alma Wallet squad&lt;/strong&gt; by supporting engineers’ development, hiring the right profiles and creating an environment where the team can do its best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build an effective delivery system&lt;/strong&gt; by improving team processes, rituals and collaboration with Product, Design and the other Consumer squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver a strategic payment roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; covering the Alma card, Apple Pay and Google Pay, local payment methods, the consumer point-of-sale experience, identity verification and Open Banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the technical bar and protect reliability&lt;/strong&gt; through code reviews, technical design discussions and a strong focus on the quality and resilience of payment flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧰&lt;strong&gt; You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Mobile&lt;/em&gt;: Expo / EAS, React Native, TypeScript, TanStack Query, Redux Toolkit, Zod, Reanimated, Jest, Detox. Payment SDKs: Adyen, Stripe, &lt;a href=&quot;http://Checkout.com&quot;&gt;Checkout.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Back-end&lt;/em&gt;: Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, PostgreSQL, Redis, Pub/Sub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Infra &amp;amp; observability&lt;/em&gt;: GCP, Kubernetes, Docker, ArgoCD, Datadog, Sentry, OpenFeature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tools&lt;/em&gt;: GitHub, Linear, Notion, Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧩&lt;strong&gt; About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have 3+ years of experience managing or leading engineers, including hiring and supporting team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have strong hands-on technical credibility in mobile or back-end engineering, and are comfortable reviewing code and leading architecture discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have experience delivering products in a cross-functional squad with Product and Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You are fluent in both French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have experience in fintech or another regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have worked with payment methods, payment service providers or PSP SDK integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have contributed to a consumer mobile application used at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have mobile engineering experience, ideally with React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧘&lt;strong&gt; What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Alma Wallet squad from the ground up&lt;/strong&gt;, helping define its ways of working, team culture and engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own projects at the heart of Alma’s strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, including the Alma card, Apple Pay and Google Pay, local payment methods and the evolution of the consumer payment experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work on a modern, end-to-end product stack&lt;/strong&gt;, from Expo, React Native, React 19 and TypeScript 7 on mobile to Python and FastAPI on the back-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🤑&lt;strong&gt; Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and Classpass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🎯&lt;strong&gt; Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video screen with Sara, Talent Acquisition Manager&lt;/strong&gt; — 30–45 minutes to discuss your experience, motivation and the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience interview with Tony Miksa, Hiring Manager&lt;/strong&gt; — 45 minutes to explore your management experience, technical background and fit with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coding test with a Software Engineering interviewer&lt;/strong&gt; — 45–90 minutes, depending on your main programming language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System design interview with a Staff Engineer interviewer&lt;/strong&gt; — 60 minutes to discuss architecture, technical trade-offs and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coffee chat with members of the Consumer tribe&lt;/strong&gt; — 60 minutes with a combination of Product and Engineering team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference checks&lt;/strong&gt; — two professional references.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt; Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe that commerce should be balanced and sustainable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to put finance back where it belongs: &lt;strong&gt;at the service of merchants and consumers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build Buy Now Pay Later solutions that help merchants increase sales while enabling consumers to manage their budget responsibly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25,000+ active merchants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10 million consumers served&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4.8/5 on Trustpilot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team has grown from 2 to more than 350 people and we continue to expand across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Customer Care Officer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a key role in ensuring a smooth and reliable experience for both merchants and consumers using Alma.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support users, resolve complex requests and contribute to improving our operational processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in &lt;strong&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;, with &lt;strong&gt;2 days of remote work per week&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Occasional weekend shifts may be required (approximately twice per quarter).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; merchant support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle complex requests from merchants and consumers via email and phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide users in the use of Alma’s payment solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear and helpful responses while ensuring a high level of customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; process management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage debt collection actions and follow up on payment delays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth onboarding of new merchants and help them implement the Alma solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor cases and ensure issues are resolved efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring issues and share insights to improve processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to quality reviews and operational improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the onboarding and training of new team members as the team grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You would be a great fit if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong written and verbal communication skills in &lt;strong&gt;French and English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;customer-oriented&lt;/strong&gt;, empathetic and solution-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;organized and rigorous&lt;/strong&gt; in your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;autonomous and resourceful&lt;/strong&gt; when solving problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working in a &lt;strong&gt;fast-growing environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A first experience in &lt;strong&gt;customer support, operations or similar roles&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offices in &lt;strong&gt;Paris (10th arrondissement)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Lille – Euratechnologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance fully covered for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers (Swile)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable mobility package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choice of laptop (Mac or Windows)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular team events and internal talks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The process includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introductory interview with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online test&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with the Team Lead or Operations Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team fit discussion with members of the Operation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place — serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience — without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR in 2025, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alma is a lender. We originate several million consumer receivables a year, carry them for a few weeks, and refinance them off a deliberately light balance sheet through securitization vehicles (Fonds Communs de Titrisation) and our other funding lines. We are regulated as a société de financement and a payment institution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That changes what &quot;accounting&quot; means here. A lender&#39;s accounts are not a monthly deliverable produced at the end of a chain: &lt;strong&gt;they are the chain&lt;/strong&gt;. Every payment event, every commission, every provision, every sale of receivables to an FCT has to become a journal entry that ties — to the transaction underneath it, to the general ledger above it, and to the prudential statements the regulator reads. At our scale and growth, this is a strategic topic, and one that is as much about data as it is about accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today the chain exists: an internal core banking ledger we built ourselves, feeding NetSuite, feeding regulatory reporting. What it does not have is a single owner who understands it end-to-end, holds it to the standard a regulated lender needs, and evolves it as the business changes (geographies, products, licenses). That is the role we are opening.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join an Accounting team inside a Finance organization of ~15 people covering Strategic Financing, FP&amp;amp;A, Accounting, Regulatory reporting and Controlling. You will report to the Head of Financing &amp;amp; Accounting, alongside the Financing team and the General Accounting Manager, who oversees corporate cycles, tax, statutory and consolidated accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with unusual ownership for its level: the banking accounting scope is yours from day one, and so is the data chain that produces it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the accounting of the credit business:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own how the portfolio is represented in the books: origination, revenue recognition on merchant and customer commissions, deferred income, write-offs and recoveries, cost of risk and provisioning on performing and non-performing exposures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the accounting of our securitizations: sales of receivables to the FCTs, derecognition, discount and over-collateralisation, residual interests, servicing and management fees, hedging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the accounting of our funding: corporate debt, commercial paper, and the new funding instruments we add as the refinancing strategy evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the core banking ledger:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the functional owner of the engine that turns business events into accounting: which event, which account, which currency, which date, which counterparty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specify and validate the accounting schemes for every new product, partner and geography, and work with Engineering and Data on the ledger&#39;s model, its feed into the ERP, and the fixes when something drifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the audit trail end-to-end — from a single €40 installment to a line in a prudential statement — and make it documented enough to be walked through by someone whose job is to challenge it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reinforce the control framework:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and automate the reconciliations that hold the whole thing together: ledger ↔ general ledger ↔ bank ↔ FCT reporting ↔ prudential statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shorten monthly close, incl. turning a manual, end-of-month, spreadsheet-based check into an automated, evidenced, repeatable control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Finance&#39;s counterpart to Internal Control and Periodic Control on everything accounting-data related.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own regulatory reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the production and the quality of our prudential and statistical reporting — solvency, large exposures, liquidity, and the statistical returns that go with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the reconciliation tables that matter most: prudential statements to accounting balances, regulatory returns to the trial balance, own funds and RWA back to their audit trail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the reporting tooling and its data feeds, and work with the Regulatory and Financing teams on the evolutions of the prudential framework and on the treatment of our securitizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have around 6-7 years of experience, ideally starting in audit of financial services — banks, consumer credit, asset management, securitization — in a Big 4 or a specialised practice, possibly with a first move in-house. You know how to build a number, prove it, and defend it line by line in front of people whose job is to challenge it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know banking accounting for real: French banking GAAP, the PCEC, cost of risk, revenue recognition on credit products. Or you know financial services accounting well enough that the banking layer is a matter of months, not years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You actually enjoy controls at scale — reconciling large populations, hunting the anomaly, chasing the last twelve euros of a four-hundred-million balance until you know exactly where they went. If that sounds tedious rather than satisfying, this is not your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are autonomous and scrappy. On things to build, or on things that already exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English and French — our documentation and our regulator are French, part of our business and our team are not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold, or are working towards, the DEC (or CPA, ACCA, equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have been exposed to securitization — FCTs, SPVs, waterfalls, deconsolidation — or to a regulated credit institution from the inside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are autonomous on data.&lt;/strong&gt; SQL is a daily tool, a data warehouse does not intimidate you, and your reflex in front of a five-million-row population is to query it, not to ask someone for a summary. This is the single most important line in this job description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know NetSuite, BigQuery, dbt or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in a scaling fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and Classpass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🎯 Interview Process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with Thibaut Mercier, Head of Financing, Regulatory Capital Optimization &amp;amp; Accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with Stephanie Combe, CFO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;orange_heart&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🧡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;open_hands&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;👐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You will join Alma’s central Data team, which supports a wide range of business teams, including Finance, Product, Marketing, Risk, and Operations. The team is made up of six Data Analysts, including several experienced colleagues, and works at the intersection of Data Engineering, Data Analytics, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Reporting to &lt;a class=&quot;text-blue-600 hover:underline hover:text-blue-800&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/gilmarlard/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Gil Marlard&lt;/a&gt;, you will help strengthen the data foundations that support reporting, analytics, operational processes, and business decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is a permanent (CDI) role based in Paris, with a hybrid working model, we are also open to full remote in France.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;briefcase&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;💼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;As an Analytics Engineer, you will help strengthen the data foundations that support the whole organization. The central Data team serves a wide range of business teams, including Finance, Product, Marketing, Risk, and Operations. You will join a team of six Data Analysts, including several experienced colleagues, and work at the intersection of Data Engineering, Data Analytics, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You will transform raw data into trusted datasets that support reporting, analytics, operational processes, such as deciding which customer to call, and business decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Our data foundations currently have different levels of maturity across business teams, and part of our ambition is to rebuild and standardize some of them. Your work will be particularly important in enabling more self-service and conversational analytics for our business teams, by making data easier to find, understand, trust, and use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;A key part of your role will be improving the lineage and governance of our tables, following a medallion-inspired approach with clear layers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data modeling and data quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Build and maintain reusable data models, macros, and semantic layers in dbt and BigQuery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Develop staging, intermediate, and mart models following clear data modeling principles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Implement data quality tests, freshness checks, and documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Improve the lineage, ownership, and discoverability of our most important tables&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Strengthen our semantic layer and ensure that metric definitions are consistent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Identify and remove duplicated, obsolete, or deprecated datasets and content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Optimize queries and models for reliability, performance, and cost&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Central Data Analytics Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Build reusable data assets that can be leveraged by Data Analysts across different business domains&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Lead enablement by mentoring analysts and training them on dbt, Looker, governance, and metric definitions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Partner on the data platform roadmap across GCP, BigQuery, Argo, dbt, and Looker&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Contribute to keeping our data stack clean, reliable, and easy to maintain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews and help define analytics engineering standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Discuss and validate data contracts with the rest of the Engineering team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Data Analysts, Data Engineers, and business stakeholders to deliver trusted and actionable data&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;toolbox&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🧰&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;dbt, BigQuery, Looker, GCP, Argo, Git, Claude&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;jigsaw&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🧩&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have at least 2 years of experience in Analytics Engineering, Data Engineering, Data Analytics, or a similar role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have practical experience with dbt, including models, tests, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have a good understanding of data modeling concepts such as facts, dimensions, keys, and relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have experience with Git and pull-request-based development, excellent communication skills, and the ability to collaborate with technical and business teams. You are fluent in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You are familiar with BigQuery, Looker, GCP, and Airflow or Argo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;You have knowledge of Python.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;person_in_lotus_position&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🧘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;The opportunity to shape analytics engineering practices within a growing and experienced central Data team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern data tools including dbt, Argo, Claude, GCP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;A collaborative environment focused on improving data reliability, data literacy, and self-service analytics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
