&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;dart&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🎯&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
