&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Video call with your future manager to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
