&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proton was founded in 2014 by scientists from CERN on a simple truth: &lt;strong&gt;privacy is a fundamental human right&lt;/strong&gt;. Since then, we&#39;ve built the world&#39;s largest encrypted email service (Proton Mail) and expanded into Proton VPN, Proton Drive, Proton Pass, and Proton Calendar — tools used by millions globally to protect their freedom, fight censorship, and keep their data safe. In some situations, Proton has literally helped save lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are profitable, independent (no VC control), and selectively hire from the top ~1% of applicants. Our 700+ team members across 50+ countries come from leading organizations and elite academic backgrounds. We move fast, keep hierarchy light, and prioritize impact over optics. If you want to do meaningful work with exceptionally high-caliber people, this is it. Check our open-source projects &lt;a href=&quot;https://proton.me/community/open-source&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Purpose of the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Storage is at the very center of everything we do. Whatever needs to be persisted eventually uses our Storage infrastructure. For this we run our infrastructure predominantly on-premise in multiple data centers. In this role you will join the Storage SRE team that is responsible to automate, scale, enhance and run our Storage infrastructure. The office locations we hire into for this role are Geneva/Switzerland or Paris/France.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Design, build, and operate resilient Storage infrastructure for Proton’s most critical production services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain automation tools to enhance deployment processes, configuration management, and service reliability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Improve monitoring, alerting, and incident response to maintain high availability and rapid issue resolution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Optimize and scale Proton’s infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product and security teams to implement best practices for privacy and data protection at every layer of the stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Document and share knowledge to foster a culture of learning and continuous improvement within the team and beyond&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Work closely with a group of Back-End Engineers and Architects to build resilient, massively-scalable solutions for millions of people to rely on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Document back-end capabilities and their proper use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Join the oncall rotation to operate the Storage service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Job requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Experience building complex production systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Operational experience, demonstrating the ability to diagnose and troubleshoot complex problems for critical systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Experience with software development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of security best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;High-level understanding of cryptography concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Bonus points for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Experience with storage systems (e.g. Ceph, Seaweed or Tape)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Even if you don’t meet all the requirements listed above, but feel you could still be a great fit, please apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Office First:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proton is an office-first company. We expect you to spend most of your time in the office, and while we do offer some flexibility to work from home, we believe in-person collaboration helps us build the best products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We provide all the devices and software you need to excel in your role, ensuring you have the best tools at your disposal to achieve your goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lunch and snacks are provided by Proton every day at our offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Transport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;We will always support our employees with transport costs through subsidizing public transport, bike allowances, or parking spaces based on your office location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&amp;nbsp; : Paris - &lt;/strong&gt;Base Annual Gross - 50,000€ to 77,000€ - Final compensation will be determined based on the candidate&#39;s qualifications, skills, and previous experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Proton, we are all owners of the company and you&#39;ll be offered stock options when you join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;You can define your own working hours as long as it works with team meetings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to your professional growth. Proton offers various learning opportunities, including training programs, conferences and events, and continual learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance plans, competitive retirement savings options, generous vacation and leave policies, and wellness programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proton is a community-first organization, started with the support of a crowdfunding campaign and built with community input. To this day, Proton’s only source of revenue is user subscriptions. Over 100 million people trust and support Proton, and we put our users and community first in everything we do. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton Technologies AG (Proton, we, us, or our), your information is stored in Greenhouse, in accordance with their&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Service Privacy Policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position. We also retain this information for consideration for future roles that you may apply for or that we believe may align with your background and skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymize it. Should you have any inquiries about how we use or manage your information, or if you wish to access, correct, or delete your data, please contact our privacy team at -----
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any sources other than directly from candidates. We will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited offer, even if the candidate is subsequently hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our privacy policy, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;our privacy policy page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;As a Production Engineer, you will play a key role within our Test Engineering team, programming test software and documenting test procedures to scale production of our next-generation drone platforms. In this position, you will take ownership of verification and production test equipment, from defining test concepts to designing automated test solutions, jigs and needle-bed adapters that help us improve yield and reliability. You’ll collaborate closely with our software and electronics engineers and OEM partners to enhance test coverage and reduce testing time, driving efficiency across our manufacturing process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role in a fast-paced, agile environment, offering the opportunity to design creative, practical test solutions from concept through to mass production. This involves balancing the transition from our existing test setups to more scalable and complete solutions in a pragmatic and iterative way for a number of different projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond test engineering, you’ll apply your software expertise across the broader hardware and software team by supporting the engineering validation efforts of new products. You will also visit OEMs to support new product integrations and support small scale engineering runs in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, design and build test solutions, including auto generated, 3D printed test equipment and CNC milled custom test jigs, and needle-bed adapters to enable low-volume prototyping and mid- to high-volume PCB production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute product verification, covering test case definition, execution, analysis, and comprehensive documentation, also for repair guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Python code and STM32 firmware to test our embedded products from the inside (selftest) and outside (via test fixture).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional engineering teams by offering technical guidance and hands-on support for testing and validation of advanced avionics PCBs and modular systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specify and document additional manufacturer tests (like flying probe) to allow for a layered, holistic approach to test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Repair Guides that document the error cases and the affected components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide manufacturers with new product integrations usually in person in the factory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage tracking systems across multiple locations to inspect the product workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal CI systems with real hardware to validate test procedures before upgrading test fixtures at OEMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Electrical Engineering, Computer Science or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in modern Python and C/C++ also applied to embedded systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in programming software that runs on real hardware and testing it on real hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAD experience (e.g., Onshape) and soldering skills are required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience in Linux, microcontroller programming, 3D printing, and related prototyping tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic, solution-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good verbal and written English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software and electronics platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an enthusiastic Electronics Engineering Intern to gain hands-on experience designing, building, testing, and debugging electronic hardware. Working alongside senior engineers, you’ll contribute across the development cycle—from schematic and PCB design through prototyping, testing, debugging, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, assemble, test, and debug prototype circuits and PCB assemblies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with schematic capture and PCB design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use lab equipment such as oscilloscopes, multimeters, power supplies, and signal generators for testing and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support soldering, rework, and other hands-on laboratory activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and test firmware for microcontrollers and embedded systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse test results and document designs, tests, and project progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior engineers to troubleshoot technical issues and improve hardware performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow engineering and laboratory safety procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a Master’s degree in Electrical/Electronics Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of analog and digital circuit design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PCB design tools such as Altium, KiCad, or Eagle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with electronics lab equipment and basic soldering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience in C, C++, Python, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with STM32, ESP32, Arduino, or other microcontrollers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of communication protocols such as I²C, SPI, UART, CAN, or USB is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving, communication, and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience through university, robotics, or personal electronics projects is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Field / Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Approximately 50% (Client sites, etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Cognite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cognite is a global industrial Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) company enabling the full-scale digital transformation of heavy-asset industries. Our core software product, Cognite Data Fusion (CDF), powers companies with contextualized OT/IT data to develop and scale solutions that increase safety, sustainability, and operational efficiency while driving revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Business Development Director within our Supply Chain Center of Excellence (CoE)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive Cognite’s growth by winning new Supply Chain business within accounts headquartered in your territory. Operating as a subject matter expert, you will leverage deep domain insights to help customers transform their supply chain value chain using Cognite Applications and the Cognite Data Fusion Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory &amp;amp; CoE Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute a targeted territory strategy to accelerate bookings growth and secure high-impact supply chain clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively prospect and leverage your personal network to generate pipeline, providing compelling &quot;commercial insights&quot; on optimizing the supply chain value chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Sales Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead extended territory teams (including pre-sales and technical experts) through complex enterprise sales cycles to exceed bookings targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Quantify ROI and present strong business cases to help enterprise executives justify software investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; work with partners to qualify and progress their pipeline, and drive joint engagements on qualified opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account / Engagement Leader in negotiating favorable pricing and commercial terms with C-level executives by demonstrating the long-term strategic value of Cognite’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal Product Management and Marketing teams to feed real-market supply chain insights back into product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Hygiene &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account Leaders and their First Line Managers in accurately forecasting monthly/quarterly bookings and maintaining up-to-date account records in &lt;a href=&quot;http://salesforce.com&quot;&gt;Salesforce.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills, Abilities (KSAs) &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep domain expertise in complex Supply Chain operations for Energy, Manufacturing or Power Utilities verticals. Understanding of Production operations and industry x.0 initiatives is also required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Value Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to sell value and build quantified ROI frameworks for prospective buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Informal Leadership, Influence &amp;amp; Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; High degree of self-motivation, time management, and ability to informally lead and effectively influence cross-functional deal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Stellar presentation, written, and verbal communication skills tailored for C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Technical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Software/SaaS:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven mastery of selling complex analytics or data platforms (e.g., AI, Big Data, Data Warehousing, Business Intelligence, Machine Learning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Ecosystems:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern data architectures and tools, such as Big Data frameworks (Hadoop, Spark, Hive, BigQuery), Data Warehouses, and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience in the Manufacturing and broader industrial supply chain environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years of direct or in-support sales experience, selling enterprise software/SaaS (BI, Big Data, Advanced Analytics, or AI/ML) to C-level executives, Management and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated history of consistently meeting or exceeding SaaS bookings goals in direct / partner / channel-based sales models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience operating in high-growth startup environments (Series A, B, or C stage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us Great &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Values:&lt;/strong&gt; High autonomy, a culture of speed and openness, social and diversity initiatives (Together@Cognite), and a commitment to innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive base + variable compensation, 401(k) employer matching, fully covered health/dental/vision/disability premiums, and learning stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Unlimited PTO, paid parental leave, and catered company lunches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
