&lt;li&gt;Design and craft expert-level player combat mechanics, weapons and abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with Leads and Directors of other disciplines, particularly art and engineering, and ensure that everyone is on the same page before beginning mechanics/feature development.&lt;/li&gt;
