&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a project specific &lt;strong&gt;Project Director&lt;/strong&gt; for a multi-project initiative that creates cutting-edge 3D visualization workflows supporting marketing and media production for a new urban city. the creative and strategic direction of the project(s) or programmes in their remit. This role leads the full design and delivery teams, owns the client relationship at a strategic level, sets the overall vision and is accountable for the quality of what we produce and how it speaks to the client’s requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is not programme responsible. Every Project Director is paired with a Lead Producer or Programme PM who owns the programme plan, budget and delivery. The Project Director is the creative and strategic counterpart to that delivery lead, and the two share accountability for the overall health of the project. In addition a technical director will be assigned, who is accountable for the proper design and delivery of the technical aspects of the programme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The essential functions include, but are not limited to the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision, creative and quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sets the early-stage concept and approach, shaping the project with the client and team against the agreed contractual scope and realistic delivery requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holds the overall vision from pitch through to launch and keeps the work coherent as the project evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversees quality, technical and creative objectives, making sure client goals are met within the budget and schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads regular reviews, balancing client objectives with commercial reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client strategy and stakeholder management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns the senior client relationship on strategy and quality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds a working knowledge of the client&#39;s business and translates their goals into a project vision the team can build against.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads senior stakeholder communication on creative and strategic matters, and is the escalation point when a client has concerns about the work itself. Commercial and scheduling escalations sit with the delivery lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepares and leads the key client moments: vision presentations and milestone reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a working understanding of the technology the project is built on: what is straightforward, what is expensive, and what is risky. For Mega App this means. Digital twins, CMS systems, Web front and back end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can hold a credible conversation with engineering leads, and with the client, about technical trade-offs that affect the creative ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Does not need to be hands-on. Needs enough fluency to make informed calls and to know when to bring in a technical lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeps current with creative technology and brings relevant developments into project and pitch thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working with delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paired with a Lead Producer or Programme PM who owns the programme plan, budget, resourcing and margin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Also teamed with a Technical Director who owns the technical architecture, advises on approach and communicates back to the technical team on scope&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributes to scoping and estimating: shapes what is being proposed and its level of ambition so estimates reflect what will actually get built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raises changes in scope or ambition early, and works through the trade-offs with the delivery lead rather than presenting them as decisions already made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works closely with the allocated Account Director to maximise opportunities within this client and the wider client ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures they are managing and billing incremental work scope or making decisions to zero change order based on client relationship and value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line management of project team members, indirect management of adjacent departments or disciplines as it relates to the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads performance reviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures continued professional development / training of staff in their team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participates in the interview and selection process for all project team members alongside the Lead Producer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a role model and mentor within the project and externally; participate in knowledge shares and actively improve process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Qualifications &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading creative direction on complex digital projects, ideally including apps or product-style builds rather than campaign work alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable owning senior client relationships and presenting to exec-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience working with technical fluency relevant to this project: Digital Twins, CMS systems, Web Front and Web Backend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience line managing and growing a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates a clear sense of direction and purpose for the team, in person and in writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear experience adapting well to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remaining up to date on industry trends and developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Type:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Fixed Term Contract - 12 Months&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value regular in-person collaboration because we think it leads to the best creative work however hybrid working is available around project commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application: &lt;/strong&gt;Please submit a CV demonstrating your experience along with a bespoke cover letter explaining how your experience meets the required and desirable criteria of this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviews:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Introductory calls and interviews are anticipated from 14th September. We aim to run two rounds of interview for this role with various members of our project teams, time to visit the studio and opportunity to meet more people in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions about accessibility in applying for this position please highlight this in your cover letter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We follow pay transparency, meaning we publish a salary range for each role. The salary range is the full earning potential during someone’s time in a role. Salary offers are made within this range and based on your experience and parity with the strength of our existing team/s.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£95,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£110,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Multidimensional Experience Agency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Journey is a global design and innovation agency shaping the future through multidimensional experiences (MDX) that connect people, brands, and culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our layered MDX approach crafts story-driven, sensory-rich engagement across physical, immersive, digital, and virtual spaces—fuelled&amp;nbsp;by creative and technological innovation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Born from a legacy of pioneering studios, Journey blends strategic thinking with deep creative&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;to deliver solutions across industries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Journey’s MDX approach fuels growth and forges lasting value for audiences and partners, by creating cultural connections that resonate with impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Start your journey here&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.journey.world/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;www.journey.world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;This role goes beyond traditional account expansion. You’ll be responsible for building and scaling how we sell across new use cases and buying centers within our install base and with net new customers. You’ll work through ambiguity to identify what resonates with customers, what drives real outcomes, and how we can create repeatable success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;You will operate at the intersection of execution and problem-solving, closing business while helping shape our sales motion, messaging, and approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity to have a direct impact on how Dropbox grows its next generation of products, with high visibility across GTM leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle from pipeline generation through close &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;and renewal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;within your territory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;Build pipeline from scratch by prospecting into new teams, departments, and executive stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;Expand beyond existing motions to uncover new use cases and opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;Consistently generate pipeline through outbound efforts, account mapping, events, and partner collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Forecast accurately and manage pipeline to consistently meet or exceed revenue targets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Lead strong discovery to uncover customer challenges, priorities, and desired outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Apply structured qualification and value-selling frameworks&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt; MEDDICC, SPICED) to advance deals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Clearly articulate business impact and position Dropbox solutions around outcomes, not features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Drive deal momentum by building urgency, aligning stakeholders, and establishing clear next steps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Contribute to evolving GTM strategy by refining ICP, messaging, and use cases&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt; Dash)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally and bring insights from the field to influence Product and GTM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;4+ years of B2B SaaS sales experience, ideally in early-stage, new product, or evolving GTM environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Proven ability to generate pipeline, manage complex deals, and close business in ambiguous or developing markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience selling to mid-market and enterprise customers, including executive stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Strong qualification and value-selling discipline, using frameworks such as MEDDICC, SPICED, Command of the Message, or similar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Consistent track record of meeting or exceeding sales targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;High-ownership, resourceful, and adaptable mindset; comfortable taking initiative and thriving without a fully defined playbook.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Strong collaborator with excellent organizational skills, CRM experience such as Salesforce, and the ability to manage pipeline and forecast effectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;Experience selling a new or emerging product within an existing portfolio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;Experience working in high-change or transformation environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;BA/BS degree or equivalent experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbserz76zbpe7snpz73zo7z78z5z74zz79zz71zz81zp70z79zz66zt8m&quot;&gt;General familiarity with AI or productivity tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z7z65z9wz73z7z75z6emz81zz70z4oz65zrz86z4dnz72ztz67zvoz67zl91&quot;&gt;Durable Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;AI fluency means using these tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;amplify&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; human judgment, not replace it. We believe people with these skills will thrive as work and technology&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;continue to evolve:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;nderstand &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; and others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;valuat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; information and mak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;decisions in complex situations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;earn, adjust, and stay effective through change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connection:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;ommunicat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;, collaborat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;, and build trust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;To learn more about why these skills matter and what the data shows about thriving through change, read this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot;&gt;blog post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt; our Chief People Officer, Melanie Rosenwasser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£109,700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£148,400 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€96.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€129.900 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;JUNIOR/SENIOR WRITERS - REFORM UK&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When did you last read something from a political party and actually finish it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most of it is written by people who have never had to convince anyone of anything.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reform UK reaches tens of millions of people and we do it with words. Very few people in politics can write for that scale. If you can, prove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write for every output the party has.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Draft directly for the party&#39;s most senior figures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work fast. You will write things that millions of people read, and that our opponents will scrutinise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ambitious. Hungry. Fast.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need a degree. You do not need to have worked in politics. You do not need to have been to the right school or know the right people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you do need: Excellent writing skills and an understanding of language and copy that appeals to a mass audience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sharp political instincts and a real feel for what people across Britain actually think, not what Westminster thinks they think. And a genuine belief in what we are doing. This is not a job you can do at arm&#39;s length; you must immerse yourself in Reform and our message.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How to apply&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write a 500-word letter, as our Shadow Home Secretary Zia Yusuf, setting out how the political class broke Britain and how Reform UK will fix it. Attach this where you are asked for a cover letter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Send that, plus your CV; examples of your writing and what it achieved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Title: Junior/Senior Writer - dependent on experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay: competitive, dependent on experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Reform UK HQ, Westminster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interviews: ASAP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Westminster, London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Executive Editor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reform UK is seeking an exceptional Data &amp;amp; Analytics Lead to build a best-in-class organisation-wide data and insight function from the party&#39;s Westminster headquarters. This is a broader opportunity than a conventional web or social analytics role: the successful candidate will help bring together disparate strands of performance, audience, membership, campaign and operational information into a coherent decision-making system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data &amp;amp; Analytics Lead will establish the data stack, reporting definitions, access, dashboards and analytical rhythms that allow senior leaders and teams across Reform UK to see what is happening, understand why and act quickly. Digital channels will be an important part of the role, but the aim is to create a shared source of decision-ready insight across the organisation wherever useful data exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the organisation-wide data and insight function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map the major data sources, owners, definitions, access rights, reporting rhythms and decision needs across Reform UK, identifying duplication, gaps and areas where information is currently fragmented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement a practical data stack that can bring together appropriate information from digital channels, website, search, email, ReformGo, membership, campaigns and other organisational systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear definitions, baselines, targets and data-quality standards so senior leaders are not making decisions from conflicting numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a roadmap that moves the organisation from isolated reports and manual extracts towards trusted, timely and increasingly automated decision support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build dashboards that drive decisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create intuitive dashboards and scorecards for senior leadership and operational teams, focused on decisions rather than data for its own sake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop role-appropriate views so executives can see the organisation-wide picture while teams can drill into the detail they need to manage performance day to day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connect output and activity to outcomes wherever attribution is reasonable, helping teams understand movement from attention to owned relationship, repeat behaviour, membership, participation or other useful actions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automate recurring reporting and data preparation where practical, reducing manual effort and increasing the frequency and reliability of insight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure dashboards show trends, targets and context rather than isolated totals that can easily mislead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn raw data into insight and action&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Produce concise, decision-ready analysis that explains what changed, why it matters, what is likely driving it and what the organisation should do next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify where audiences, members or supporters stop progressing through journeys and work with relevant teams to test improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a disciplined test-and-learn framework with hypotheses, success criteria and post-test analysis so the organisation learns systematically rather than anecdotally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use segmentation and cohort analysis to uncover meaningful patterns in behaviour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed data-driven decision-making across Reform UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with the Executive Editor, Director of Operations and other senior stakeholders to establish regular performance and insight reviews that lead to impactful decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support Website, Video, Social, Communications, Campaigns, Membership, Operations and other teams with practical analysis, helping each function understand its own performance in the wider system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenge weak assumptions and vanity metrics constructively, distinguishing signal from noise and making clear where the evidence is incomplete or attribution is uncertain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Train colleagues to understand the dashboards and core metrics so data literacy increases throughout the organisation rather than becoming dependent on one analyst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own governance, compliance and trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be the internal expert on data governance for the analytics function, ensuring work aligns with UK GDPR, the Data Protection Act, ICO guidance and relevant organisational policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with the DPO and system owners on lawful basis, consent, minimisation, retention, access, pseudonymisation, URL/log hygiene and appropriate use of personal data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain clear data lineage, permissions and documentation so key metrics are reproducible and sensitive information is available only to those who genuinely need it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance and Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build alerting and monitoring for material changes, broken journeys, unusual movements or data-quality failures where rapid intervention is valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior leaders, digital teams, campaigns, membership, operations, suppliers and technical partners so the data function is seen as an enabler rather than a reporting bottleneck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex analysis in clear, plain English, surface new ideas and be confident presenting findings to senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external analytics, BI, data or technology suppliers where required, ensuring integrations, costs and deliverables are properly controlled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain political awareness and discretion when working with sensitive organisational, membership or campaign data and understand that some insights will be operationally or reputationally sensitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE PERSON&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a senior data and analytics expert who has built practical insight capability before and can turn fragmented information into a trusted system that improves decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential experience and capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of establishing or materially improving a data, analytics, BI or insight operation in a complex organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience integrating disparate data sources and designing a practical reporting architecture rather than relying on disconnected manual reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable ability to build dashboards that colleagues actually use, with clear metrics, trends, context, drill-downs and decision relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical judgement: able to distinguish signal from noise, explain uncertainty, avoid misleading attribution and turn numbers into actionable insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical competence with relevant data, analytics and BI tools, including the ability to work effectively with APIs, structured data, automation and modern dashboarding platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining KPIs, baselines, targets, cohorts and measurement frameworks across multiple functions or stages of a user/member journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills, including the ability to explain complex analysis to non-technical senior stakeholders and influence decisions without hiding behind jargon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert understanding of UK GDPR, the Data Protection Act, ICO guidance, consent, minimisation, retention, access controls and good data-governance practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, self-sufficient and able to manage multiple stakeholders, systems, dependencies and priorities while maintaining clear documentation and data trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and pragmatic: willing to build a useful first version quickly, automate what matters and improve iteratively rather than waiting for a perfect enterprise architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in British politics and comfort handling sensitive information within a high-profile, mission-led political organisation where discretion and judgement are essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work full-time from Reform UK&#39;s Westminster HQ and flex around major political, campaign and reporting moments when rapid analysis is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in political campaigning, media, membership organisations, subscriptions, CRM, advocacy or another environment where behaviour moves across multiple online and offline touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL, Python/R, data-modeling or warehouse experience and the ability to work directly with technical teams when deeper implementation is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up experimentation, causal measurement, attribution or structured test-and-learn frameworks while communicating methodological limits clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of changing organisational behaviour through insight - for example reallocating resource, improving reach/conversion/retention, changing messaging or stopping low-value activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Reform UK?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to build the intelligence layer of a fast-growing national political organisation rather than inherit a narrow analytics brief. The successful candidate will bring fragmented information together and shape how senior leaders make decisions across Reform UK.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Position: Campaigns Administrator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Department: Campaigns&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to: Head of Campaigns&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Westminster (Full-Time Contract)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hardworking, organised and proficient administrator to support the&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Staff and wider team within the Campaigns Department. The postholder will play a key role in ensuring the smooth and effective administration of the department’s ongoing projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will involve managing the department’s inbox, maintaining departmental records&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and databases, coordinating multiple projects, and providing administrative support to the Head of Campaigns and other Senior Staff. The postholder will work closely with colleagues across the Campaigns Department, both in Head Office and in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will have exceptional organisational and communication skills, a strong attention to detail, and the ability to manage competing priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Monitoring and managing the department’s inbox, ensuring queries and issues are appropriately followed up and resolved promptly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating the day-to-day administration and organisation of multiple campaign projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining and updating departmental databases, records, and other key documents, ensuring information is accurate throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing administrative and organisational support to the Head of Campaigns and Senior Staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing detailed reports, briefings and other materials for senior staff and, where required, Party Leadership, often at short notice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the department with ad hoc administrative tasks and responding flexibly to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional organisational and administrative skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous professional experience working in a political, campaigning or public affairs environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple tasks and competing priorities effectively, while maintaining accuracy and meeting tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Google Workspace and strong IT skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1tdt3aq&quot; data-start=&quot;163&quot; data-end=&quot;235&quot;&gt;Graphic Designer (Print &amp;amp; Campaign Materials) – Reform UK Head Office&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;237&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot;&gt;As Reform UK’s national operation continues to expand, we are looking to engage a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;319&quot; data-end=&quot;391&quot;&gt;Graphic Designer with a strong focus on print and physical materials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to support our growing communications and campaign teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;666&quot;&gt;This role will focus on producing&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;485&quot; data-end=&quot;583&quot;&gt;high-quality printed materials that communicate Reform UK’s message clearly and professionally&lt;/strong&gt;, from literature and mail-outs to manifestos, brochures, signage, and merchandise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;668&quot; data-end=&quot;853&quot;&gt;You will play an important role in shaping the&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;715&quot; data-end=&quot;756&quot;&gt;physical visual identity of Reform UK&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring our printed materials are consistent, well-produced, and impactful across the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;164ueu3&quot; data-start=&quot;855&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;880&quot; data-end=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p2sf36&quot; data-start=&quot;880&quot; data-end=&quot;979&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;882&quot; data-end=&quot;979&quot;&gt;Design&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;889&quot; data-end=&quot;940&quot;&gt;literature, leaflets, and direct mail materials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for national and local communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l21hih&quot; data-start=&quot;980&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Produce layouts for&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;manifestos, policy documents, commercial brochures and more&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mpoujj&quot; data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1137&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1137&quot;&gt;Design&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;signage, event graphics, banners, and display materials&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cxcx3n&quot; data-start=&quot;1138&quot; data-end=&quot;1197&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1140&quot; data-end=&quot;1197&quot;&gt;Create artwork for&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;merchandise and branded materials&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5fgt0r&quot; data-start=&quot;1198&quot; data-end=&quot;1256&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1256&quot;&gt;Ensure&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1207&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;brand consistency across all printed outputs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p36u71&quot; data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1384&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1259&quot; data-end=&quot;1384&quot;&gt;Work closely with the&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1281&quot; data-end=&quot;1320&quot;&gt;communications and operations teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to translate messaging into clear and effective printed design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18daky2&quot; data-start=&quot;1385&quot; data-end=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1387&quot; data-end=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;Prepare&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1395&quot; data-end=&quot;1418&quot;&gt;print-ready artwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and support production with external printers and suppliers when required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;14esvje&quot; data-start=&quot;1495&quot; data-end=&quot;1511&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1512&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1srhjg1&quot; data-start=&quot;1512&quot; data-end=&quot;1658&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1658&quot;&gt;Proven&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1521&quot; data-end=&quot;1550&quot;&gt;graphic design experience&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally in print-focused roles such as marketing, publishing, branding, advertising, or commercial design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19cp7jy&quot; data-start=&quot;1659&quot; data-end=&quot;1743&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1661&quot; data-end=&quot;1743&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1683&quot; data-end=&quot;1742&quot;&gt;Adobe Creative Suite (InDesign, Illustrator, Photoshop)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6orxpd&quot; data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1746&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1770&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;print production, layout design, typography, and visual hierarchy&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xf5e21&quot; data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1938&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1938&quot;&gt;Experience preparing&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1864&quot; data-end=&quot;1937&quot;&gt;print-ready artwork and working with printers or production suppliers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;50h4os&quot; data-start=&quot;1939&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1941&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;Ability to&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1952&quot; data-end=&quot;2000&quot;&gt;manage multiple projects and tight deadlines&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16pwgxd&quot; data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2086&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2004&quot; data-end=&quot;2086&quot;&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to maintain&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2085&quot;&gt;consistent brand standards&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s16hrw&quot; data-start=&quot;2087&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2089&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;A strong commitment to the&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot;&gt;values and mission of Reform UK&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ixx92j&quot; data-start=&quot;2154&quot; data-end=&quot;2166&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2167&quot; data-end=&quot;2363&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity to join&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2198&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;Reform UK’s growing Head Office team&lt;/strong&gt;, helping produce the printed materials, literature, and branded assets that support the party’s expanding national presence.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission: Why Lighthouse?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Lighthouse, we’re on a mission to revolutionize commercial strategy as hospitality’s most powerful AI platform. We take the world&#39;s largest hotel data network and transform it into real-time intelligence that drives action. We don&#39;t just deliver insights; we empower businesses to make decisions that move revenue.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;With $370M in Series C funding and over $100M in ARR, we are scaling at lightspeed. Our 850+ teammates across 35 countries aren&#39;t just building software—they are leveraging cutting-edge AI to help hoteliers be the first to act. Tens of thousands of hotels across 185 countries trust Lighthouse to execute their commercial strategy, including every one of the top 15 global chains and thousands of independent hotels that consistently outperform their markets. With Lighthouse AI, the intelligence gets deeper. Decisions get smarter. Actions get faster. We help hoteliers be first to act.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lighthouse Values: Our guiding light&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot;&gt;Lumineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Our shared values keep us on a collaborative path fostering a cultural and customer centric environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pursuit of greatness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;: We’re innovators who care deeply about our customers’ success. Our team brings their best work, stays curious, and delivers excellence through attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meaningful work matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;: We make every moment count by knowing what to deliver, why it matters, and how it drives Lighthouse forward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate each other&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;: We don’t just work together - we grow together. What unites us is understanding each other as people and working toward shared goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re more than just a workplace – we’re a community. Collaborative, fun, and deeply committed, we work hard together to revolutionize the hospitality sector. Are you ready to join us and shine brighter in the industry’s most exciting rocket-ship? 🚀&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;● 💼 Revenue Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;● 📍 United Kingdom&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;● 🕜 Full-Time - Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll be the face of Lighthouse for our most strategic prospects, owning complex, multi-stakeholder deal cycles from prospecting to close. This is a senior hunter role: you carry a significant quota, you build your own pipeline, and you’re accountable to outcomes and success. No excuses, just results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What makes this different: you won’t do it alone. Lighthouse is deploying an agent AI infrastructure — Enablement, Pre-Sales, and Coaching agents — alongside a modern revenue stack. AI handles the prep, the sequencing, and the pattern recognition so you can focus on what matters — building relationships, running sharp discovery, and closing deals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will have impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your territory and your number. &lt;/strong&gt;Build and execute a strategic territory plan targeting high value and enterprise accounts. Maintain 3x pipeline coverage, forecast honestly, and take full accountability for your results. Your quota is your commitment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunt and build a pipeline. &lt;/strong&gt;Source a meaningful share of your own pipeline through outbound sequences, ICP targeting, your existing network, Lighthouse Connect events, and industry conferences. Activate relationships from prior roles and industry tenure. This is not an SDR-reliant role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run a disciplined sales process. &lt;/strong&gt;Using MEDDPICC to qualify and advance opportunities. Use the AI Pre-Sales Agent to identify gaps before every major call. Navigate complex deal cycles with multiple stakeholders and longer timelines. Advance deals through stage gates with evidence, not optimism. Leverage AI to make your days easier and focus on more selling time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI as a force multiplier. &lt;/strong&gt;Leverage the Enablement Agent for call prep, discovery frameworks, and positioning. Use the Coaching Agent to surface patterns in your pipeline and win rate. Push back on the tools when they’re wrong — help make the system smarter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a hospitality expert. &lt;/strong&gt;Understand the commercial challenges hotels face across pricing, distribution, and business intelligence. Position Lighthouse’s full platform as the integrated solution that replaces fragmented point tools. Know the competitive landscape inside out and run value based ROI conversations confidently.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive results beyond net-new. &lt;/strong&gt;Consistently meet and exceed sales targets through new business and by identifying expansion and upgrade opportunities within your accounts. Partner with Product to share market feedback and influence the roadmap. Represent Lighthouse at industry events to build the brand and your network.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate the team around you. &lt;/strong&gt;Share deal strategies, competitive insights, and best practices with the broader AE team. Informally mentor newer reps and contribute to playbooks and enablement content. This isn’t a management role, but leadership is expected.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Our Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll join a global Revenue team of 150+ sales professionals across 24 countries. &lt;strong&gt;Our team works across the full Lighthouse product suite, helping hotels, chains, and hospitality groups achieve their commercial goals&lt;/strong&gt;. It’s a collaborative, high-energy environment with real opportunities for career growth and the chance to learn from experienced leaders as we continue to expand our market share.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible working environment: Work from home or at one of our global offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health insurance: Private AXA coverage for you and your family.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible time off: Autonomy to manage your work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation: Proactively maintained to value your work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborative team: High-bar, friendly, creative, and passionate colleagues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Career development: Workshops and frameworks to realize your full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Impactful work: Shape products relied on by 85,000+ users worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Wellbeing support: Subsidized up to 80% ClassPass subscription.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Referral bonuses: Earn rewards for bringing in new talent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Additional maternity leave compensation: For the first 12 weeks of Statutory Maternity Pay (SMP), we top-up your SMP so that your salary reaches 100%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;3+ years in a closing sales role with a consistent track record of hitting or exceeding quota. SaaS experience is essential; hospitality tech is a strong advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Self-directed, coachable, and driven to continuously improve. You seek feedback on your calls, your pipeline, and your positioning — and act on it within the next deal, not the next quarter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You treat AI tools as a core part of your selling motion, not a novelty. You adopt new tooling quickly and bend it to your style.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ve worked with MEDDPICC or similar qualification frameworks and can demonstrate how structured deal execution has driven your results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to sell on value, not price. Confident engaging stakeholders from GMs to C-suite and navigating complex buying committees.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You want to win. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You prospect when it would be easier not to. You follow up one more time. You’re not okay with a bad quarter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Thank you for considering a career with Lighthouse. We are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace that values equal opportunity for all. We welcome candidates from all backgrounds, regardless of age, gender, race, religion, sexual orientation, and disability. Our commitment to equality is part of our culture. If you require reasonable accommodation at any point during the application or interview process, please notify your recruiter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Not ticking every box? No problem! We value diverse backgrounds and unique skill sets, and we encourage individuals from all walks of life to apply. If your experience looks a little different from what we&#39;ve described, but you&#39;re passionate about what we do and are a quick learner, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.mylighthouse.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more about our careers and recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;| &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.mylighthouse.com/company/about&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our company and leadership team&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(253, 130, 55);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.mylighthouse.com/company/beware-of-recruitment-scams&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Beware of recruitment scams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;mt4&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grey’s mission is to create Famously Effective ideas that move people, businesses, and the world forward, harnessing the power of creativity to solve business challenges and drive growth for some of the world’s most influential brands and companies, including Procter &amp;amp; Gamble, Volvo, Haleon, Circle K, and The Coca-Cola Company. That commitment to effectiveness has earned Grey a Grand Effie in every market where it operates. Grey was recognized as a 2025 Fast Company World Changing Ideas winner and earned 26 Lions at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity, contributing to Ogilvy’s Network of the Year honors. Newsweek also named Grey a Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplace in 2024 and one of America&#39;s Greatest Workplaces for Women and Professional Services in 2025. Grey is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the brands that shape health.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Grey Health, we believe health brands deserve the same ambition, creativity and cultural relevance as the world&#39;s most iconic consumer brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Brand Strategist&lt;/strong&gt; who is endlessly curious about people, behaviour and culture. Someone who loves untangling complex challenges, finding unexpected opportunities and turning insights into ideas that make a genuine impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to work at the intersection of strategy, creativity, science and culture, helping to build brands that don&#39;t just communicate healthcare, but make it matter.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll partner with some of the industry&#39;s most talented creatives, medical experts and client leaders to create work that changes perceptions, influences behaviour and delivers business results.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Brand Strategist, you&#39;ll play a key role in developing insight-led brand and communications strategies for healthcare, wellness and pharmaceutical clients.From uncovering audience insights and market opportunities to shaping creative platforms and client narratives, you&#39;ll help turn complexity into clarity and create ideas that inspire action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who combines analytical thinking with creative imagination and enjoys moving seamlessly between research, strategy, storytelling and collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop insight-led brand, positioning and communications strategies.Identify human, cultural and category insights that unlock growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex healthcare and scientific challenges into clear strategic narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write inspiring creative briefs that spark outstanding creative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with creative, medical, engagement and client teams throughout the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and facilitate workshops, stakeholder sessions and strategic planning discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present recommendations confidently and help shape client thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring fresh perspectives, new provocations and innovative approaches to every project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of strategic workstreams and help drive projects forward with energy and initiative.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing brand and communications strategies within healthcare, pharma or wellness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of consumer behaviour, audience insight and brand growth principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building strategies from insight through to activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional storytelling, presentation and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex information and identify opportunities others might miss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to workshops, stakeholder engagement and collaborative problem-solving sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A balance of analytical rigour and creative thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset with a genuine passion for learning and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re someone who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is naturally curious and always asking better questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loves understanding how people think, feel and behave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives on solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is comfortable with ambiguity and enjoys exploring new territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brings energy, positivity and collaboration to every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is ambitious about the work, but humble in how you approach it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys challenging conventional thinking and pushing ideas further.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wants to create work that has a meaningful impact on people&#39;s lives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At Grey,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;have the opportunity to work at an incredible studio, with some of the most creative and inspired people in the industry, all whilst getting to grow &amp;amp; shape your career with us. We offer a competitive salary, lots of training, plenty of benefits and wellbeing&amp;nbsp;perks&amp;nbsp;too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At Grey, we know that the more diverse the input, the more famous and effective the output. Different perspectives spark bigger ideas, braver&amp;nbsp;creativity&amp;nbsp;and better work - and that starts with how we welcome new talent. We embrace applications from&amp;nbsp;people underrepresented&amp;nbsp;in our industry and value the unique skills,&amp;nbsp;experiences&amp;nbsp;and viewpoints everyone brings. Our goal is simple:&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;a place where everyone can belong, and no one feels the need to hide any part of who they are.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;That spirit runs through our application process too. If&amp;nbsp;there’s&amp;nbsp;anything - from neurodivergence, to&amp;nbsp;a health&amp;nbsp;condition, or any other circumstance - that might shape your experience, just let our People team know.&amp;nbsp;We’ll&amp;nbsp;work with you to make the adjustments you need to show your best, and&amp;nbsp;we’ll&amp;nbsp;treat whatever you share with respect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of the possibility of recruiting fraud. &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #e03e2d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GREY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; does not conduct interviews via instant messaging platforms and will never request personal financial information such as bank account numbers, credit card information, or payment of any kind during the hiring process. All legitimate communication will come from an official @&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #e03e2d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GREY.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;com email address. If you suspect fraudulent activity, please report it to us immediately. Stay vigilant and protect your personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Retail Associate to join our London team. Our ideal candidate is warm and curious, with a natural instinct for service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in an ambitious environment where we are reimagining what modern luxury can feel like, sharing your knowledge of our products with care and acting as a true ambassador for everything Tekla stands for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The primary location for this position is Marylebone High Street, though occasional support at our Selfridges counter, a short walk from the store, may also be required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should enjoy taking on responsibility and feel a genuine interest in understanding what each customer needs. A real appreciation for our brand and for premium product, paired with an eagerness to learn and to share what you know, will be at the heart of your success here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time position, and because of the rhythm of the store, availability during evenings and weekends is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day in this role looks a little different, but you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build genuine, lasting relationships with our customers through thoughtful clienteling, making each visit feel personal and unhurried.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host our VIP clients in store and at private appointments, offering informed advice with care and discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the store&#39;s daily operations, including sales, visual merchandising, and replenishment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of our products and how to care for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share regular reporting and customer feedback with the store manager and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work both independently and with the team to ensure the day runs smoothly and to meet our shared goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on other ad hoc duties as and when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a customer-facing role, ideally within premium or luxury retail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in clienteling, from personalised follow-ups to building a loyal client base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of premium product: what sets it apart, and how to speak about it with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hosting VIP clients at a high level and reporting feedback to senior management would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, detail-oriented approach, with a genuine interest in helping others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Warmth, curiosity, and the ability to start conversations and build relationships with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the confidence to adapt to different customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to work weekends and evenings when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine appreciation for our brand and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We review applications and hold interviews on an ongoing basis, with the aim of welcoming the successful candidate to the role as soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At Reltio®, an SAP Company, we believe data should fuel your success in the enterprise AI era. Our&amp;nbsp; Context Intelligence Platform turns fragmented data into a trusted, connected context so AI agents and systems can act with expert-level judgement at enterprise scale. Reltio’s cloud-native SaaS platform harmonizes, unifies, and governs data across sources and formats—including unstructured data—in real time, turning them into data assets that can be mobilized in milliseconds to any application, user, or AI agent. Trusted by more than 200 of the world’s largest brands across industries such as life sciences, financial services, healthcare, and technology, we fuel frictionless operations and help enterprises accelerate&amp;nbsp; innovation and reduce risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Reltio, our values guide everything we do. With an unyielding commitment to prioritizing our “Customer First”, we strive to ensure their success. We embrace our differences and are “Better Together” as One Reltio. We are always looking to “Simplify and Share” our knowledge when we collaborate to remove obstacles for each other. We hold ourselves accountable for our actions and outcomes and strive for excellence. We “Own It”. Every day, we innovate and evolve, so that today is “Always Better Than Yesterday”. If you share and embody these values, we invite you to join our team at Reltio and contribute to our mission of excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reltio has earned numerous awards and industry and analyst recognition for our technology, our culture and our people. Reltio was founded on a distributed workforce and offers flexible work arrangements to help our people manage their personal and professional lives. If you’re ready to work on unrivaled technology where your desire to be part of a collaborative team is met with a laser-focused mission to enable digital transformation with connected data, let’s talk!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Consultant at Reltio plays a pivotal role in the sales process, partnering with Account Executives to understand prospective customers&#39; business challenges and to articulate the value of Reltio&#39;s cutting-edge data unification and AI-driven solutions. This individual will be responsible for developing and delivering compelling presentations and demonstrations, designing tailored solution architectures, and acting as a trusted technical advisor to prospects. The ideal candidate is passionate about data, possesses strong communication and presentation skills, and thrives in a fast-paced, innovative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the sales team to identify and qualify sales opportunities, understanding customer needs and business objectives related to data unification and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver engaging, customized product demonstrations and presentations that effectively showcase Reltio&#39;s value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and propose high-level solution architectures that address specific customer requirements and integrate with their existing technology landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver highly customized, compelling product demonstrations and proof-of-concept (POC) engagements that showcase differentiated value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to technical questions and objections from prospective &amp;amp; existing customers, providing clear and concise explanations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage technical aspects of Request for Proposals (RFPs) and Request for Information (RFIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with technical stakeholders and decision-makers within prospect/customer organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends, competitive landscape, and Reltio&#39;s product advancements in data unification and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback from the field to Product Management and Engineering teams to contribute to product enhancement and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the creation of sales tools, best practices, and re-usable assets for the pre-sales organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support marketing events, including trade shows and webinars, by delivering presentations and demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience/Skills/Education/Abilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3 years of experience in pre-sales, solutions consulting, or a similar customer-facing technical role within the enterprise software industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable understanding of enterprise data challenges, data integration concepts, and the value of data unification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to articulate complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation, communication (written and verbal), and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to think strategically and analytically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise software sales cycles and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Engineering, Business, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to customer locations as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Experience/Skills/Education/Abilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS solutions, cloud architectures, and data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI/ML concepts and their application in data management or business intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS, Google Cloud Platform (GCP), or Microsoft Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of specific industry verticals (e.g., Life Sciences, Healthcare, Financial Services, CPG/Retail)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data modeling, ETL processes, or API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reltio is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Reltio is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodation to applicants with physical and mental disabilities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

