&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON, 7-9 Sunbank Ln, Altrincham WA15 0AF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Nutrition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;23&quot; data-end=&quot;248&quot;&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the world’s most trusted and best-loved wellbeing and nutrition brands, including Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand, alongside Myvitamins and MP Activewear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;446&quot;&gt;Our brands and people exist to break boundaries — to power and empower those who want more. We move fast, challenge convention, and back ourselves to win. These values shape how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;448&quot; data-end=&quot;730&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About Regulatory &amp;amp; Compliance and the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Regulatory and Compliance team&#39;s primary focus is to ensure product formulation, labelling and website compliance for all THG Nutrition and Beauty brands globally. THG owns and operates many leading brands including LookFantastic.com, Grow Gorgeous, Mio Skincare, ESPA and MyProtein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG is looking to recruit a&amp;nbsp;Senior Regulatory Officer (UK /&amp;nbsp;EU)&amp;nbsp;with a good understanding of UK / EU Regulations pertaining to labelling of food and food supplements for UK/EU Countries, to join our Regulatory &amp;amp; Compliance Team.&amp;nbsp;The role is reporting into the EU Regulatory Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a focus on brand protection, the Regulatory &amp;amp; Compliance Team plays a critical role in ensuring that our products can be marketed and sold legally all over the world. The role offers hybrid working from our Head Office near Manchester Airport, this role offers the opportunity to contribute to the Global success of The Hut Group and our market-leading brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Managing one Regulatory Associate, including setting objectives and cascading departmental objectives to direct reports.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting from a regulatory position on key business projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upkeep and maintenance of a comprehensive suite of applicable regulations and guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identifying potential Regulatory / compliance issues and working together with the senior members of the team to reduce and/or eradicate their impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee and input on regulatory requirements for New Product Development (NPD) and Existing Product Development (EPD) for THG Nutrition Brands including Myprotein, Myvegan, and Myvitamins.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with NPD on new formulations to ensure compliance in the UK and EU Member States.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing labelling, marketing material (including campaigns/scripts/clearcast/assets) to check that they are compliant with regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising on nutrition and health claims, ensuring they are correctly worded on product labelling and websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing company websites to check that content is compliant with country specific regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completing food supplement product registration in in the UK and EU Member States.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assessing regulatory risk against commercial requirements and completing risk assessments as and when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in Trade Association meetings, review communications, gather relevant data to help lobby for change as and when relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Horizon scanning - Using own initiative to define upcoming regulatory challenges in the UK / EU market based on changes in regulations and/or market trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting on internal and external auditing including BRC and ISO (training provided).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly review policies to ensure they are up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create training materials &amp;amp; provide training/upskilling for team members, wider teams and stakeholders as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing and maintaining a strong working relationship with key stakeholders (NPD, Marketing, Brand, Commercial teams etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting on routine nutrition analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualification in Nutrition, Food Technology, Food Law, Food Science, Food Safety or other related subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great understanding of regulations regarding food and food supplements and usage of claims in the UK/EU.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great understanding of food industry standard practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail, strong communication skills and good time management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate across different departments e.g. NPD, Brand, Marketing, SQA, QA, Packaging Artwork etc to ensure business needs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of food supplement product registration process in EU Member States would be desirable but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good IT Skills - (Email, Excel, Word and SharePoint).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of product specification systems (especially Oracle Brand Compliance) would be desirable but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you have experience managing, supporting and guiding a small team this would be an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2737&quot; data-end=&quot;2757&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for me?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2759&quot; data-end=&quot;2777&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2779&quot; data-end=&quot;3016&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i6mc1e&quot; data-start=&quot;2779&quot; data-end=&quot;2882&quot;&gt;Access bespoke development programmes that have been designed and developed by our in-house L&amp;amp;D team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o4jcdc&quot; data-start=&quot;2883&quot; data-end=&quot;3016&quot;&gt;Continued development through our upskilling programme that is delivered in partnership with an industry-leading training provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3032&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhanced Leave&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3034&quot; data-end=&quot;3351&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k3lh31&quot; data-start=&quot;3034&quot; data-end=&quot;3076&quot;&gt;25 days annual leave plus bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1621qdr&quot; data-start=&quot;3077&quot; data-end=&quot;3158&quot;&gt;Don&#39;t want to work on your birthday? We don&#39;t either! Enjoy your day off on us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hezlgt&quot; data-start=&quot;3159&quot; data-end=&quot;3230&quot;&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity pay, depending on length of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jpyk5h&quot; data-start=&quot;3231&quot; data-end=&quot;3267&quot;&gt;Up to 10 days compassionate leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ecn3j5&quot; data-start=&quot;3268&quot; data-end=&quot;3302&quot;&gt;Buy back up to 3 days each year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tm5uws&quot; data-start=&quot;3303&quot; data-end=&quot;3351&quot;&gt;Unlock 2 days volunteer leave after 12 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3353&quot; data-end=&quot;3370&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3372&quot; data-end=&quot;3577&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4q42t8&quot; data-start=&quot;3372&quot; data-end=&quot;3440&quot;&gt;Access face-to-face and virtual appointments with our in-house GP and Dentist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1skxewv&quot; data-start=&quot;3441&quot; data-end=&quot;3513&quot;&gt;Access our 24/7 Employee Assistance Programme (EAP), provided by Bupa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s0j02n&quot; data-start=&quot;3514&quot; data-end=&quot;3545&quot;&gt;State-of-the-art on-site gym.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3579&quot; data-end=&quot;3590&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3592&quot; data-end=&quot;3977&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16w21x2&quot; data-start=&quot;3592&quot; data-end=&quot;3674&quot;&gt;Save up to 12% on the cost of personal tech through our salary sacrifice scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qridvw&quot; data-start=&quot;3675&quot; data-end=&quot;3744&quot;&gt;Subsidised bus pass from Manchester City Centre to our ICON office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;109gasx&quot; data-start=&quot;3745&quot; data-end=&quot;3786&quot;&gt;Up to 50% staff discount on THG brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19vgosj&quot; data-start=&quot;3787&quot; data-end=&quot;3808&quot;&gt;On-site staff shop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18dj4sf&quot; data-start=&quot;3809&quot; data-end=&quot;3917&quot;&gt;Know someone who would be perfect for THG? Refer them and get up to £1,000 when they pass their probation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a0pci4&quot; data-start=&quot;3918&quot; data-end=&quot;3977&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Anniversary gifts when you hit 5 and 10 years of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;thread-bottom-container&quot; class=&quot;sticky bottom-0 z-10 group/thread-bottom-container relative isolate w-full basis-auto has-data-has-thread-error:pt-2 has-data-has-thread-error:[box-shadow:var(--sharp-edge-bottom-shadow)] md:border-transparent md:pt-0 dark:border-white/20 md:dark:border-transparent print:hidden content-fade single-line flex flex-col&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;thread-bottom&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;text-base mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 mb-[var(--thread-component-gap,1rem)]&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aker Systems was founded in 2017 by a team of experienced technology professionals who recognised an opportunity to provide highly secure enterprise data platforms to large organisations.&amp;nbsp; We build and operate ground-breaking, ultra-secure, high performance, cloud-based data infrastructure for the enterprise. Our proprietary technology solutions drive performance and reduce costs while helping our clients to improve the management and sharing of data across their organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2024, Aker Systems won the Breakthrough Culture Awards highlighting growth companies putting culture first. In 2020 Aker Systems was recognised as a ‘One to Watch’ on the Sunday Times Tech Track.&amp;nbsp; The Company was also recognised at the Thames Valley Tech Awards 2020; winning the Thames Valley Tech Company of the year, the Emerging Tech Company and High Growth Tech Business categories.&amp;nbsp; We encourage people of all different backgrounds and identities to apply.&amp;nbsp; We are committed to maintaining an inclusive, and supportive place for you to do your very best work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Due to the nature of the project,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;UK Government Security Check (SC) clearance is required&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to design, build and operate secure, scalable and reliable data platform capabilities across client delivery projects in the &lt;strong&gt;public sector and utilities&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with Data Engineers, Software Engineers, Architects, DevOps Engineers and client stakeholders to develop and maintain &lt;strong&gt;cloud-native data platforms supporting batch, real-time streaming, analytical and operational workloads&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on engineering role focused on building reliable platform services, automating infrastructure and deployments, supporting production environments and contributing to technical design decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;cloud platforms, distributed systems and real-time streaming technologies&lt;/strong&gt; is highly desirable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, test and deploy &lt;strong&gt;data platform services and components&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain platform capabilities supporting &lt;strong&gt;batch and real-time data workloads&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and operate distributed data services using &lt;strong&gt;Kafka, Kinesis, Spark, Flink or equivalent technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain cloud-native data platform capabilities using &lt;strong&gt;AWS and/or Azure&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data ingestion, processing, storage and integration across multiple systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain &lt;strong&gt;data models, schemas and platform data structures&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support schema evolution, data quality and data integrity across distributed platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate data platforms with relational and NoSQL databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop automated testing and validation for platform services and data processing components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; for data platform workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code&lt;/strong&gt; to create repeatable and maintainable environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Docker and Kubernetes-based platform environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor platform services and investigate failures, performance issues and operational problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in incident investigation and &lt;strong&gt;root cause analysis&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support platform performance, scalability, resilience and availability improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to platform security, governance and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Software Engineers, Data Engineers, DevOps and Architects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in technical design discussions, code reviews and engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement of platform engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Technical Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial experience as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Platform Engineer, Senior Data Engineer, Platform Engineer, Software Engineer or similar&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience building and operating &lt;strong&gt;cloud-native data platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming experience using &lt;strong&gt;Java and/or Python&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;real-time streaming and event-driven architectures&lt;/strong&gt;, including Kafka, Kinesis or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed data processing technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;Spark, Flink, Kafka Streams&lt;/strong&gt; or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;AWS and/or Azure&lt;/strong&gt; cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud services such as &lt;strong&gt;S3, Glue, Lambda, RDS, Athena, EC2&lt;/strong&gt; or Azure equivalents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;data platform architecture, data pipelines and distributed processing&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;relational and NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills and understanding of data modelling and schema design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD and DevOps practices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using &lt;strong&gt;Terraform or equivalent Infrastructure as Code technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Docker and/or Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using &lt;strong&gt;GitHub/GitLab&lt;/strong&gt; and modern source control practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing monitoring, logging and &lt;strong&gt;observability&lt;/strong&gt; for platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting production systems and resolving technical and operational issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of platform security, resilience, scalability and availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within &lt;strong&gt;Agile and/or DevOps delivery environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable:&lt;/strong&gt; Helm, ArgoCD, Airflow, dbt, Bash, Ansible, Packer, Elasticsearch/OpenSearch, Prometheus, Grafana, ELK or Datadog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within &lt;strong&gt;public sector, utilities or other regulated environments&lt;/strong&gt; is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Platform Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Platform Engineer, you will take ownership of complex platform engineering activities within your client delivery team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reliable &lt;strong&gt;data platform components and services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical design and implementation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable and maintainable platform patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data ingestion, processing, storage and integration capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify platform risks relating to &lt;strong&gt;performance, scalability, security and reliability&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to platform performance tuning and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews and promote clean, maintainable engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support production troubleshooting and root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and support less experienced engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving platform automation, reliability and engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud, Infrastructure &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across modern cloud and infrastructure technologies, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AWS and/or Azure&lt;/strong&gt; cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as Code using &lt;strong&gt;Terraform or equivalent&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Docker and Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; containerised environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD using GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated provisioning and configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring, logging, alerting and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform security and access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience, backup and disaster recovery considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should have &lt;strong&gt;5+ years of relevant professional experience&lt;/strong&gt; across Data Engineering, Data Platform Engineering, Software Engineering, Platform Engineering or a similar technical discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a Senior-level appointment, you should demonstrate strong &lt;strong&gt;hands-on technical capability, ownership of complex platform engineering activities and the ability to work independently within client delivery environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on Data Platform Engineer who enjoys building and operating the infrastructure and services that make modern data platforms work reliably in production&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are comfortable working across &lt;strong&gt;cloud platforms, streaming, distributed systems, data processing, Infrastructure as Code and containerisation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand that effective data platforms need to be &lt;strong&gt;secure, scalable, observable, resilient and maintainable&lt;/strong&gt;, not simply capable of processing data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take ownership of your work, enjoy solving complex technical problems and work well with engineers across different disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are pragmatic, technically curious and focused on delivering &lt;strong&gt;reliable platform capabilities that create measurable value for clients&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working within &lt;strong&gt;public sector, utilities or other complex and regulated environments&lt;/strong&gt; would be highly advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Aker Systems Attributes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Aker we work as a team; we are collaborative, hardworking, open, and delivery obsessed. There is no blame culture here: try things, and take responsibility for the outcomes. You are always part of the wider Aker. We help our colleagues and take pride in successfully achieving difficult tasks. We run towards problems and help to solve them. Communicate always, do so accurately and in a timely fashion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In return, we offer a competitive salary, 25 days holiday plus bank holidays, company paid medical insurance and life assurance, pension scheme, annual training allowance, wellbeing allowance, virtual GP, Employee Assistance plan and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aker Systems fosters a diverse environment that encourages openness in its communications and is committed to providing equal employment opportunity for all people regardless of race, religion, gender or sexual orientation, age, marital status, national origin, citizenship status, disability, veteran status or other personal characteristics. We embrace differences of opinion and diversity because they help challenge us and find new groundbreaking technical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aker Systems was founded in 2017 by a team of experienced technology professionals who recognised an opportunity to provide highly secure enterprise data platforms to large organisations.&amp;nbsp; We build and operate ground-breaking, ultra-secure, high performance, cloud-based data infrastructure for the enterprise. Our proprietary technology solutions drive performance and reduce costs while helping our clients to improve the management and sharing of data across their organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2024, Aker Systems won the Breakthrough Culture Awards highlighting growth companies putting culture first. In 2020 Aker Systems was recognised as a ‘One to Watch’ on the Sunday Times Tech Track.&amp;nbsp; The Company was also recognised at the Thames Valley Tech Awards 2020; winning the Thames Valley Tech Company of the year, the Emerging Tech Company and High Growth Tech Business categories.&amp;nbsp; We encourage people of all different backgrounds and identities to apply.&amp;nbsp; We are committed to maintaining an inclusive, and supportive place for you to do your very best work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aker Systems designs, builds &amp;amp; operates advanced, ultra-secure data infrastructure, delivering data modernisation at enterprise scale to enable AI-driven transformation and seamless sharing of trusted data at scale, predominantly for highly regulated and Central Government clients in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aker has proven tech-enabled service offerings - covering the entire client lifecycle through strategic cloud &amp;amp; data capability leadership, secure cloud and data infrastructure modernisation, managed services in client environments and data &amp;amp; platform engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aker powers AI digital transformation through trusted, enterprise scale data modernisation with proven mission critical, secure, trusted and real-time expertise &amp;amp; solutions. With deeply trusted relationships and influence, innovative technology and excellent delivery track record.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Client Focus&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working for national security and defence clients in the Southwest in the long term, across both short and long-lived programmes of work, as part of an Agile team of likeminded individuals that thrive on solving real-world problems, keeping the UK safe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will support you in obtaining enhanced DV Clearance. Whilst eDV is being processed, you will be working with our Central Government clients on SC level work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer, you will help lead the development of backend platforms and services for National Security and Defence clients leveraging the latest commercial and open-source technologies in private and public cloud environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, document, deploy and enhance features to our platforms and services that meet functional / non-functional business requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in the team’s elaboration and estimation of user stories&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build frequent, small releases to maintain the team’s momentum&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with other engineers in our cross-functional feature teams; ensuring that others can cover for you, and that you can cover for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, optimise and operate our Continuous Deployment pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain operational responsibility for the services that your team owns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Core Competencies&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will have at least 5 years professional experience delivering production grade cloud solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have demonstrated the following competencies to the proficiency level appropriate to the seniority of the role;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in writing JAVA coding and experience with JVM compatible languages (Kotlin, Scala)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka or a similar platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile DevSecOps environments and Zero Trust Architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrating with backing services, such as PostgreSQL, Redis or S3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good engineering practices including continuous delivery, clean code, documentation, defensive programming, automated testing and code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using GitHub/GitLab/Atlassian Suite for source control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test Driven Development with appropriate tools and frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with micro-service design patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Big Data technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Aker Systems Attributes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Aker we work as a team; we are collaborative, hardworking, open, and delivery obsessed. There is no blame culture here: try things, and take responsibility for the outcomes. You are always part of the wider Aker. We help our colleagues and take pride in successfully achieving difficult tasks. We run towards problems and help to solve them. Communicate always, do so accurately and in a timely fashion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In return, we offer a competitive salary, 25 days holiday plus bank holidays, company paid medical insurance and life assurance, pension scheme, annual training allowance, wellbeing allowance, virtual GP, Employee Assistance plan and more.&lt;/p&gt;
