&lt;p&gt;You will support the design, development, integration, and testing of advanced Electronic Warfare capabilities on STARK’s internal EW platforms, contributing to performance across complex and highly dynamic RF environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
