&lt;li&gt;Assist in designing and implementing hardware setups related to RF sensing and signal acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support System integration tasks through mechanical design, and cable harness development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing, debugging, and validation of electronic systems to ensure stability and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
