&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As Automation Engineer, you build and deploy automations that eliminate manual effort across operations and the back-office. You work across RPA, LLM-based tooling, and API integrations — and you are as likely to be automating an invoice approval chain as a production line data feed. You measure success in hours saved and errors eliminated.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design and build RPA workflows for operational and back-office processes — UiPath, Power Automate, or equivalent&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Develop LLM-based automation tools for document-heavy workflows: invoice extraction, quality certificates, order processing, email triage&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Integrate automation solutions with ERP, MES, and business applications via APIs&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build agent-based workflows where multi-step reasoning or decision-making is required&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Test, deploy, and maintain automations in production — including monitoring, alerting, and incident response&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Document automation logic, dependencies, and maintenance procedures thoroughly&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work with operational and back-office teams to identify, scope, and prioritise new automation opportunities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;3–6 years building automations in an operational or business process context&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Has shipped working automations into production — not just proof-of-concept or demo environments&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;RPA tools — UiPath, Power Automate, or equivalent (hands-on production experience)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Python scripting — for custom automation logic, API integration, and LLM tool use&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;API integration — REST APIs, webhooks, data exchange across ERP and business systems&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Process analysis and QA mindset — automations must be reliable, not just functional&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;BSc in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or similar&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;LLM-based tooling — prompt engineering, agent frameworks (LangChain, LlamaIndex, or similar)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;ERP system familiarity (SAP, Microsoft Dynamics, or similar)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Manufacturing or back-office finance/ops experience&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark Defence, we are committed to building a diverse, inclusive, and high-performing team. We operate in an industry where women, as well as other minority groups, are systematically under-represented. We actively encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds and identities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are excited about this role, we encourage you to apply even if you don&#39;t meet all the listed qualifications—ability and impact cannot be summarised in a few bullet points. We value unique perspectives, adaptability, and a drive to solve high-stakes challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Security Clearance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 class=&quot;sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 ghXWGq custom-css-style-job-description&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Reporting Line:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW53634494 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW53634494 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At constellr, we use thermal intelligence from space to understand what is happening on Earth - where, when and at scale. Our satellite constellation delivers high-resolution land surface temperature data, giving governments, defence organisations, commercial operators and global institutions the intelligence they need to monitor change, assess risk and make better-informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From national security and critical infrastructure to agriculture and climate resilience, constellr turns temperature into actionable intelligence for a changing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As our Senior Business Development Manager for the Public Sector, you will join the Commercial team and lead constellr’s growth with civil government customers – environmental ministries, national and regional agencies, and European institutions – who need reliable, decision-grade thermal intelligence to manage water, agriculture, infrastructure and climate resilience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is not a data-reselling role. You will sell data intelligence and analytics: understanding what public bodies are trying to achieve, shaping how our land surface temperature products and insights fit their mandates, and guiding them through funding cycles and formal procurement. You will work closely with our Product, Earth observation science and Solutions teams to translate remote sensing capability into solutions that answer real governmental needs, and alongside colleagues covering commercial, industrial and defence markets to build a coherent go-to-market across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will own a strategic portfolio from first conversation to signed contract, including major upcoming national and EU tenders, and build on constellr’s existing success in European programmes such as Copernicus. With the launch of the world’s first commercial thermal infrared constellation, the relationships you build and the deals you win will define how governments use thermal data for years to come.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;14&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Public-Sector Growth:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Own and grow &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;constellr’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; civil public-sector business, developing a targeted pipeline across environmental ministries, national agencies, research-funded &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;programmes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; and European institutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
