&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;CMBlu Energy befindet sich auf der spannenden Reise hin zu einem globalen Cleantech-Unternehmen. Unsere Mission: Unbegrenzte Energiespeicherung nach dem Vorbild der Natur ermöglichen – und das für alle, weltweit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Was sind&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;SolidFlow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;-Batterien?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;SolidFlow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;-Batterien speichern Energie in organischen Molekülen. Der Verzicht auf explosive Materialien macht sie sicher, der Einsatz von sozial und ökologisch konfliktfreien Rohstoffen nachhaltig und die nahezu unbegrenzte Materialverfügbarkeit skalierbar und günstig in der Beschaffung. Das macht&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; unsere patentierte&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;SolidFlow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Technologie&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; zu einem &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Gamechanger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; im Aufbau eines globalen klimaneutralen Energiesystems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Vom Start-up zum Scale-up: Gemeinsam packen wir es an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;CMBlu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; Energy entwickelt sich von einem Start-up mit Forschungsschwerpunkt zu einem produzierenden Scale-up, das sich auf dem Sprung in die Serienproduktion befindet. An diesem Ziel arbeiten rund 250 Mitarbeiterinnen und Mitarbeiter bei &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;CMBlu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; Energy. Unser Hauptsitz ist &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Alzenau&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; nähe Frankfurt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;, mit einer Zwei&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;g&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;stelle in Obernburg. Hinzu kommen Tochtergesellschaften in Athen, Griechenland und Petaluma, USA.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du baust unsere Azure-Plattform aus – Netzwerk, Identity, Compute – und zwar als Code in Git mit Review, nicht per Klick im Portal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du sorgst gemeinsam mit dem Team dafür, dass Labore, Prüfstände, Simulation/HPC und OT IT-seitig schnell und sicher arbeiten können, und entwickelst mit den Fachbereichen Lösungen, die ihnen den Rücken freihalten.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du baust unsere Self-Services aus, von Onboarding und Offboarding über Zugriffsanfragen bis zur Provisionierung, damit niemand auf ein Ticket warten muss.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du hältst mit dem Team unsere hybride Welt am Laufen – Netzwerk, Windows-Domäne, Microsoft 365, Virtualisierung, Backup, Monitoring – und automatisierst alles, was zweimal von Hand passiert.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du baust Security so ein, dass sie niemanden bremst: Identity-first mit Conditional Access, MFA und Least Privilege, saubere Segmentierung zwischen Office, Labor, OT und Produktion, Defender-Incidents im Griff.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Du machst uns widerstandsfähig mit Backup und Recovery, Härtung und Schwachstellenmanagement und gestaltest den Aufbau unseres ISMS sowie sichere Konzepte für KI-Werkzeuge mit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Langjährige Erfahrung in Administration, DevOps oder Platform Engineering, ein guter Teil davon mit Microsoft 365 und Azure; wer aus AWS kommt, ist genauso willkommen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Abgeschlossenes Studium in Informatik, IT-Sicherheit oder Wirtschaftsinformatik oder eine Ausbildung wie Fachinformatik Systemintegration – uns zählt, was du gebaut und betrieben hast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Netzwerk- und Systemhandwerk, das sitzt: TCP/IP, DNS, VLANs, Firewalls, VPN, 802.1X sowie Windows Server/AD, Entra ID, Linux, Virtualisierung und Backup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Infrastructure as Code als Standard: Terraform, Git, CI/CD (z. B. GitLab CI), Skripting in PowerShell, Bash oder Python; Container sind kein Neuland&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Security als Werkzeug, nicht als Verbot: PKI, Conditional Access, Least Privilege, Härtung, Microsoft Defender; idealerweise Berührungspunkte mit Labor- oder OT-Umgebungen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Verhandlungssichere Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse und eine Haltung, die Leute arbeiten lässt: lieber einmal gut erklären als dreimal verbieten, lieber automatisieren als verwalten&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deine Benefits bei der CMBLU Energy AG&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mehr Netto für dich:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Mit der&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Spendit&amp;nbsp;Card&lt;/strong&gt; erhältst du jeden Monat 50 € (bei Vollzeit) steuerfrei extra – einlösbar bei zahlreichen Visa-Akzeptanzstellen in deiner Region, ganz flexibel nach deinen Wünschen. Zusätzlich gibt dir die&amp;nbsp;Spendit&amp;nbsp;Card Zugang zu&amp;nbsp;Wellhub, einer Fitnessplattform, über die du bundesweit Fitnessstudios, Kurse und Wellness-Angebote nutzen kannst.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Gemeinsam am Erfolg teilhaben:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Über unser &lt;strong&gt;Virtual Stock Option&amp;nbsp;Program&amp;nbsp;(VSOP) &lt;/strong&gt;wirst du am Wachstum von CMBLU beteiligt. Vereinfacht gesagt: Du erhältst virtuelle Anteile, die dir – ganz ohne eigene Investition oder Stimmrechte – im Erfolgsfall einen Anteil am Wertzuwachs des Unternehmens auszahlen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nachhaltig mobil:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Wir übernehmen die vollen Kosten für dein &lt;strong&gt;Deutschland-Ticket&lt;/strong&gt;. Über&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;JobRad&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;kannst du dir zusätzlich dein Wunschfahrrad leasen, günstiger als im Laden. Ob Zug oder Rad: Du kommst klimafreundlich und komfortabel ans Ziel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Frisch und lecker durch den Arbeitstag:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Am Standort Alzenau erwarten dich am &lt;strong&gt;freshtaste&lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;Verpflegungsautomat&lt;/strong&gt; täglich frische, bezuschusste Mahlzeiten.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexibel Sprachen lernen:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Mit der App&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Busuu&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;baust du deine Sprachkenntnisse in deinem eigenen Tempo aus. Den Zugang dazu stellen wir dir kostenfrei zur Verfügung.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Sinn, der antreibt:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Gestalte mit uns die Energiewende und arbeite an der Weiterentwicklung unserer&amp;nbsp;SolidFlow-Batterie mit. Seit 2026 ist CMBLU ein Unicorn, das bedeutet, unser Unternehmen wird mit mehr als einer Milliarde Euro bewertet. Mit deiner Arbeit gestaltest du dieses Wachstum aktiv mit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Kultur, die verbindet:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bei CMBLU prägen die Werte Verlässlichkeit, Innovation und Unermüdlichkeit unsere Zusammenarbeit. Gelebt wird das auch abseits des Arbeitsalltags: Beim gemeinsamen BBQ, einer Jahresabschlussfeier oder bei sportlichen Aktivitäten im Team. Unsere Erfolge feiern wir gemeinsam, denn sie sind das Ergebnis von Teamarbeit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Wir freuen uns darauf, gemeinsam mit dir die Zukunft der Energie neu zu denken.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bewirb dich jetzt und werde Teil unserer spannenden Reise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help Experience (HEX) supports tens of millions of Vinted members across 20+ markets. When members encounter an issue—from shipping delays to payment questions—we want to resolve it as fast, effortlessly, and accurately as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Data Scientist to join the Ember team within the Help Experience domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ember is building the next generation of AI-powered support at Vinted. Our mission is to &lt;em&gt;serve scalable support automation that users appreciate&lt;/em&gt;. We build and scale our conversational Virtual Assistant and automated resolution systems, transforming support from traditional ticketing into instant, conversational problem-solving. By resolving issues autonomously and helping members get back to buying and selling with confidence, Ember directly reduces operating costs and manual ticket volume supporting Vinted’s mission to make second-hand the first choice worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Conversational AI &amp;amp; Agentic Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, and scale LLM-powered virtual assistants and agents capable of multi-turn dialogue, understanding nuanced member intent, and reasoning over complex marketplace policies and real-time transaction data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Autonomous Resolution &amp;amp; Decisioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Build decision systems and classification models that know when an issue can be safely and autonomously resolved (including executing automated actions like cancellations, tracking updates, or refunds) versus when to seamlessly hand off to human support specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage Modern GenAI &amp;amp; RAG Architectures:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and optimize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), embeddings, prompt engineering, and fine-tuning techniques to deliver accurate, context-aware answers across multiple languages and noisy conversational inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish Robust Evaluation &amp;amp; Guardrails:&lt;/strong&gt; Design offline and online LLM evaluation frameworks (measuring policy compliance, hallucination mitigation, response safety, and containment quality) to ensure automated interactions are dependable and aligned with brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship to Production at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Backend Engineers and ML Platform teams to deploy and serve models in low-latency, high-throughput production environments, monitoring for drift and performance degradation in real time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner for Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Product Managers, Decision Scientists, and Customer Support Operations to identify high-impact automation opportunities, design rigorous A/B experiments, and directly move core metrics like Automation Rate, Containment, and Chatbot CSAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong technical background and hands-on experience developing machine learning algorithms. You prefer an iterative approach and can read a research paper and translate it into clean, replicable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand that behind every data point is a real member trying to get help. You succeed when the teams using your tools can make better decisions for our members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You are highly skilled in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;. You write clean, maintainable, and structured code that serves as an inspiration for others, valuing reproducibility, clarity, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You can persuasively explain complex technical concepts and their business implications to non-data stakeholders. You understand that stakeholders need to know &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; a model gave a certain score.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€74.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€100.100 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

AMPECO is one of the most innovative companies in the area of electric vehicle charging infrastructure – an industry that aims to change the world by making charging easier for everyone. As electric vehicles (EVs) are bringing in a transformation of our transport and mobility sectors, AMPECO is at the forefront of a grand revolution and we’re just getting started.
Our product – the AMPECO EV Charging Platform is a business-critical SaaS platform used by companies to manage their electric vehicle charging infrastructure, processes and energy use. It’s already in use by companies in more than 70 countries — across North and South America, Europe, Africa, Asia and Australia.
Our team is highly motivated, capable, and committed to our mission — and our growth is backed by world-class investors, including BMW i Ventures, the mobility-focused venture-capital arm of the BMW Group. We are looking to expand the team with like-minded capable people, eager to give, learn and grow together with us.
About the role
AMPECO is expanding across the DACH region, and we’re looking for a Germany-based Senior Solution Consultant - responsible for pre-sales across Germany, Austria, and Switzerland - to help drive that growth. This is a senior, individual-contributor role for someone who combines deep product and industry expertise with the interpersonal range to win the confidence of technical and business stakeholders alike.
You will be the solutioning counterpart to our DACH Business Development Manager - the two of you working as a close-knit team on the region’s most important opportunities. While the BDM leads the commercial relationship, you own the solution end to end: mapping each prospect’s business needs to AMPECO’s platform, leading demonstrations and Proof-of-Concept engagements, owning bid management for DACH opportunities — from RFx and tenders through to the supporting business case — and making the complex feel clear for everyone in the room.
You won’t be doing this alone. You’ll be enabled by an established Solution Consulting team, with proven tools, practices, and methodologies behind you — so you can put your energy into the deals in front of you. AMPECO already powers some of the most prominent Charge Point Operators in the DACH region and is in active conversations with many of the rest, so you’ll be joining at a moment of real momentum and clear opportunity to expand. As we continue to grow across Germany and the wider region, the impact you make here will be significant — with room to grow alongside it.
If you thrive in fast-paced, complex enterprise environments, enjoy working with highly driven teams, and want to play a pivotal role in the energy transition in one of Europe’s most important EV markets, this role is for you.
Responsibilities


Develop and maintain in-depth knowledge of AMPECO’s platform and the e-mobility industry, with a strong grasp of the DACH market and its requirements;


Act as the solutioning lead on strategic DACH opportunities, working hand in hand with the DACH Business Development Manager to map each prospect’s business needs to AMPECO’s capabilities;


Drive Proof-of-Concept engagements with prospective clients, ensuring the business drivers are sound, relevant, and build a compelling case to advance the opportunity;


Design and deliver effective demonstrations that connect AMPECO’s solution advantages to prospects’ business and technical requirements;


Build and maintain trusted relationships with the key stakeholders involved in DACH deals, becoming a credible advisor throughout the sales cycle;


Take an active advisory role during sales cycles, bringing solution expertise and industry best practices to the team;


Own bid management for DACH opportunities — taking end-to-end responsibility for RFIs, RFPs, RFQs, and tenders, from structuring and writing the response to coordinating input across teams and managing deadlines;


Represent AMPECO at industry events across the region and stay close to market trends, the competitive landscape, and evolving customer needs;


Travel across the DACH region as needed for customer engagements, workshops, and events.


Your Profile


6+ years of professional experience, including 3+ years in a pre-sales, solution consulting, or similar sales-focused role within enterprise or B2B software;


Native-level German and fluent English, both spoken and written — you will work with German-speaking enterprise customers daily;


Strong pre-sales execution skills: solution design, demonstrations, Proof-of-Concepts, and bid / RFx management;


Tech-savvy and a fast learner on technical topics — comfortable holding technical conversations and explaining how the platform works, without needing to be a deeply technical specialist or engineer;


A confident communicator, able to build rapport and credibility with senior business and technical stakeholders and to present complex topics clearly;


Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to structure complex challenges and shape solutions for evolving business models;


Strong business acumen — able to articulate customer value and connect AMPECO’s platform to strategic outcomes;


Based in Germany, self-driven and well-organised, and comfortable operating effectively in a remote, distributed team across the DACH region;


Naturally curious, with a genuine interest in continuously learning about the product and the industry;


A collaborative team player who works seamlessly with Sales, Product, and other specialists;


Motivated to build a long-term career in the e-mobility sector.


Considered an advantage


Domain knowledge in mobility, energy, or a related sector;


Familiarity with EV charging technology and standards such as OCPP, OCPI, or ISO 15118;


Experience working in a SaaS or PaaS environment with long, multi-stakeholder enterprise sales cycles;


Background in consulting or professional services;


Experience in enterprise sales;


Fluency in an additional European language (e.g. French, Italian).


What we offer

Competitive salary and benefits package;
Flexibility to work from anywhere in Germany or from a modern co-working space in Munich's Werksviertel, near Ostbahnhof;
Opportunity to grow with a mission-driven startup in a high-impact industry.


Our team at AMPECO is deeply committed to our mission and we're looking for like-minded individuals eager to give, learn and grow with us. If you're passionate about innovative technology and want to make a real impact in the e-mobility sector, we want to hear from you. Join AMPECO in building the future of EV charging!
&nbsp;
Our interview process is entirely remote. Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.
